msgstr "``flowing.plugins.skills`` — the Skill extension subpackage."

#: flowing.plugins.skills:3 of
msgid ""
"本包承载 Skill 扩展的全部公开符号：:class:`SkillPlugin` （阶段一插件）、 :func:`use_skill` "
"（阶段二启用）、:class:`Skill` / :class:`SkillEntry` （可执行对象与 Agent "
"级绑定）、:class:`SkillRegistry` （注册表）、 :class:`SkillLoadTool` （``skill-load``"
" 工具）、 :class:`LazySkillsPrompt` （catalog 动态块）以及 "
":data:`skill_registry_key` （provide 注入键）等；对外 API 经本 ``__init__`` 统一再导出。"
msgstr ""
"This package carries all public symbols of the Skill extension: :class:`SkillPlugin` (the phase-one plugin), :func:`use_skill` "
"(phase-two enablement), :class:`Skill` / :class:`SkillEntry` (the executable object and the Agent-level "
"binding), :class:`SkillRegistry` (the registry), :class:`SkillLoadTool` (the ``skill-load`` "
"tool), :class:`LazySkillsPrompt` (the catalog dynamic block), and "
":data:`skill_registry_key` (the provide injection key), among others; the public API is uniformly re-exported through this ``__init__``."

