msgid "功能介绍"
msgstr "Overview"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillPlugin:5 of
msgid ""
"``runtime.install(SkillPlugin(...))`` 时框架调用 ``install(runtime)``： 向 "
"runtime 的工具注册表注册 :class:`SkillLoadTool`，并以 :data:`skill_registry_key` "
"provide 一个全局 :class:`SkillRegistry`。 构造参数是 Runtime 级默认渲染模板，可被 "
"``use_skill()`` 的 Agent 级参数覆盖。``install`` 只注册、不做业务、不查询其他插件、 "
"不修改运行期状态（遵循插件约定：``install`` 只注册 / 协作不查询 / 注册只在 ``install`` / 依赖只声明）。"
msgstr ""
"When ``runtime.install(SkillPlugin(...))`` is called, the framework invokes ``install(runtime)``: it registers "
":class:`SkillLoadTool` into the runtime's tool registry and provides a global :class:`SkillRegistry` "
"under :data:`skill_registry_key`. The constructor argument is the Runtime-level default rendering template, which can be overridden by "
"the Agent-level argument of ``use_skill()``. ``install`` only registers, does no business work, queries no other plugins, "
"and does not modify runtime state (following the plugin contract: ``install`` only registers / collaborate without querying / register only in ``install`` / declare dependencies only)."

