#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillPlugin:23 of
msgid "``install()`` 同步完成全部注册；之后任何 Agent 可 ``use_skill(self)`` 启用实例级能力。"
msgstr "``install()`` completes all registration synchronously; afterwards any Agent can enable instance-level capability via ``use_skill(self)``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillPlugin:25 of
msgid "构造参数缺省 → Agent 未指定模板时使用内置 :data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE`。"
msgstr "Constructor argument omitted → when the Agent does not specify a template, the builtin :data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE` is used."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillPlugin:27 of
msgid "重复 ``install()`` 同一插件实例属编程错误（框架 ``install()`` 的通用 规则，每插件只 install 一次）。"
msgstr "Calling ``install()`` repeatedly on the same plugin instance is a programming error (a general rule of the framework's ``install()``: each plugin is installed only once)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillPlugin:29 of
msgid "不扫描任何目录、不解析任何 Skill 文件（声明期解析由 :func:`use_skill` 在实例启用时对声明条目一次性完成）。"
msgstr "Does not scan any directory and does not parse any Skill file (declaration-time parsing of the declared entries is done once by :func:`use_skill` at instance enablement)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillPlugin:32 of
msgid ""
":func:`use_skill` （阶段二入口）、 :class:`flowing.plugins.Plugin` "
"（插件基类与插件约定：``install`` 只注册 / 协作不查询 / 注册只在 ``install`` / 依赖只声明）、 "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install`"
msgstr ""
":func:`use_skill` (the phase-two entry point), :class:`flowing.plugins.Plugin` "
"(the plugin base class and the plugin contract: ``install`` only registers / collaborate without querying / register only in ``install`` / declare dependencies only), "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install`"

