#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillPlugin.install:1 of
msgid "阶段一：注册 ``skill-load`` 工具并 provide 全局 ``SkillRegistry``。"
msgstr "Phase one: registers the ``skill-load`` tool and provides the global ``SkillRegistry``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillPlugin.install:5 of
msgid ""
"``runtime.register_tool(SkillLoadTool())`` 与 "
"``runtime.provide(skill_registry_key, SkillRegistry(...))``—— Runtime "
"级默认模板随注册表注入（三级解析链中段通道）； 另把 ``registry.register`` 绑定为 "
"``runtime.register_skill``——采用 绑函数约定：检查后跳过（核心无 ``register_skill`` 方法，注册入口"
" 由本插件注入；未安装本插件时该属性不存在）。同步返回。"
msgstr ""
"``runtime.register_tool(SkillLoadTool())`` and "
"``runtime.provide(skill_registry_key, SkillRegistry(...))`` — the Runtime-level "
"default template is injected together with the registry (the middle channel of the three-level resolution chain); ``registry.register`` is additionally bound as "
"``runtime.register_skill`` — following the bind-function convention: bind after checking (the core has no ``register_skill`` method; the registration entry point "
"is injected by this plugin, and the attribute does not exist when this plugin is not installed). Returns synchronously."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillPlugin.install:11 of
msgid ""
"边缘情况：``skill-load`` 规范名已被占用 → "
":class:`flowing.errors.ToolNameConflictError` （重名永远 "
"不允许）；``skill_registry_key`` 重复 provide 是覆盖更新 （后者生效，provide "
"机制的全局约定——插件间靠键名前缀约定 避免冲突）。"
msgstr ""
"Edge cases: the canonical name ``skill-load`` is already taken → "
":class:`flowing.errors.ToolNameConflictError` (duplicate names are never "
"allowed); providing ``skill_registry_key`` again is an overwriting update (the later one wins — a global convention of the provide "
"mechanism; plugins avoid conflicts via key-name prefix conventions)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillPlugin.install:17 of
