#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill:1 of
msgid "Skill 对象模型——三种定义文件统一解析出的「可执行对象」。"
msgstr "Skill object model — the \"executable object\" uniformly parsed from the three definition file forms."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill:5 of
msgid ""
"能力三正交中 Skill 的「可执行对象」层：:class:`SkillRegistry` 把 三种定义形式（``.md`` / "
"``.skill.fya`` / 目录，见模块 docstring 「Skill 定义文件与查找规则」）统一解析为本类的实例。框架核心不 "
"认识本类——它由 ``SkillPlugin`` 定义与消费。所有 Skill 同一个类， 差异全部在数据（``description`` / "
"``content`` / ``args_schema`` / ``on_load``），不存在「内置 / 自定义」的类层次。"
msgstr ""
"The \"executable object\" layer of Skill in the three orthogonal capability axes: :class:`SkillRegistry` uniformly parses the "
"three definition forms (``.md`` / ``.skill.fya`` / directory; see the module docstring \"Skill definition files and lookup rules\") into instances of this class. The framework core does not "
"know this class — it is defined and consumed by ``SkillPlugin``. All Skills share one class; the differences lie entirely in the data (``description`` / "
"``content`` / ``args_schema`` / ``on_load``); there is no \"builtin / custom\" class hierarchy."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill:14 of
msgid "``.md`` 形式（frontmatter 为 YAML，正文为 Markdown）："
msgstr "``.md`` form (frontmatter is YAML, body is Markdown):"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill:31 of
msgid "``.skill.fya`` 形式（块结构声明，``$script`` 只用于定义 ``on_load``）："
msgstr "``.skill.fya`` form (block-structure declaration; ``$script`` is only used to define ``on_load``):"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill:54 of
msgid ""
"实例由 :meth:`SkillRegistry.get` 产出，在注册表中跨 Agent 共享 （同一 ``ns::name`` "
"全键同一实例）；调用方不得修改共享实例。"
msgstr ""
"Instances are produced by :meth:`SkillRegistry.get` and shared across Agents in the registry (the same full key ``ns::name`` "
"maps to the same instance); callers must not modify the shared instance."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill:56 of
msgid ""
"``description`` / ``content`` 的 Parsable 求值发生在每次使用 时（catalog 渲染 / "
"``skill_load``），渲染上下文是调用方 Agent ——共享实例上绝不缓存渲染结果。"
msgstr ""
"``description`` / ``content`` are evaluated as Parsable at each use (catalog rendering / "
"``skill_load``); the rendering context is the calling Agent — rendered results are never cached on the shared instance."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill:59 of
msgid ""
"本类不触发加载：加载流程编排在 ``skill_load()`` 一侧；``on_load`` 不是钩子（不走钩子 dispatch、不可 "
"``raise Intercepted`` 阻断加载； 抛普通异常则加载失败并上抛）。"
msgstr ""
"This class does not trigger loading: the loading flow is orchestrated on the ``skill_load()`` side; ``on_load`` is not a hook (it does not go through hook dispatch and cannot "
"``raise Intercepted`` to block loading; raising a normal exception fails the load and propagates)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill:62 of
msgid ""
"边缘情况：``.md`` 形式无 ``args_schema`` （空 dict），``on_load`` 为 ``None``；``.md`` "
"缺 ``description`` → 解析失败（必填字段缺失， 抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingFieldError`）。"
msgstr ""
"Edge cases: the ``.md`` form has no ``args_schema`` (empty dict) and its ``on_load`` is ``None``; a ``.md`` "
"missing ``description`` → parsing fails (required field missing, raising "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingFieldError`)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill:65 of
msgid ""
"不变量：``name`` 为规范名，与 ``SkillRegistry`` 的 key 一致； ``content`` 必填（``.md`` "
"形式即 frontmatter 之后的正文）。"
msgstr ""
"Invariants: ``name`` is the canonical name, consistent with the key in ``SkillRegistry``; "
"``content`` is required (for the ``.md`` form it is the body after the frontmatter)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill:68 of
msgid ""
":class:`SkillRegistry`、:class:`SkillEntry`、 "
":class:`flowing.parsable.Parsable`"
msgstr ""
":class:`SkillRegistry`, :class:`SkillEntry`, "
":class:`flowing.parsable.Parsable`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.Skill.name:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill.name:1 of
msgid ""
"规范名——``SkillRegistry`` 中的 key，一律由文件名 / 目录名推断 （kebab-case）。命中 "
"``<name>.skill.fya`` / ``<name>.fya`` / ``<name>.md`` "
"候选取文件名；命中通用名候选（``SKILL.fya`` / ``skill.fya`` / ``SKILL.md`` / "
"``skill.md``）取目录名。 定义文件里不禁止写 ``name``，但仅作一致性断言——与推断值 不符抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.NameMismatchError` （与 Agent / Tool 同一语义）。"
msgstr ""
"Canonical name — the key in ``SkillRegistry``, always inferred from the file name / directory name "
"(kebab-case). Hitting ``<name>.skill.fya`` / ``<name>.fya`` / ``<name>.md`` "
"candidates takes the file name; hitting generic-name candidates (``SKILL.fya`` / ``skill.fya`` / ``SKILL.md`` / "
"``skill.md``) takes the directory name. Writing ``name`` in the definition file is not forbidden, but it serves only as a consistency assertion — a mismatch with the inferred value raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.NameMismatchError` (same semantics as Agent / Tool)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.Skill.name:9
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill.name:9 of
msgid ":class:`SkillRegistry`"
msgstr ":class:`SkillRegistry`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.Skill.description:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill.description:1 of
msgid ""
"catalog ``<description>`` 的来源。保持 Parsable 而非渲染后字符串： 渲染上下文是调用方 Agent "
"的局部变量，而 Skill 实例在注册表中 跨 Agent 共享，只有使用时才能求值。catalog 渲染时由模板经 "
"``.resolve(agent)`` 现场求值（见 :data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE`）。"
msgstr ""
"Source of the catalog ``<description>``. Kept as Parsable rather than a rendered string: the rendering context is the calling Agent's "
"local variables, while the Skill instance is shared across Agents in the registry, so it can only be evaluated at use time. At catalog rendering the template evaluates it on the spot via "
"``.resolve(agent)`` (see :data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE`)."

#: ../../../docstring builtins.str:28
#: flowing.plugins.skills.Skill.description:6
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill.description:6 of
msgid ":data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE`"
msgstr ":data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.Skill.content:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill.content:1 of
msgid ""
"Skill 正文（执行指南），惰性求值——存的是「如何解析」的指令， 不是解析结果。``skill_load()`` 对其 "
"``resolve``：先展开 ``$`` 文件 引用，再执行 Jinja2 模板渲染；渲染上下文包含调用方 Agent 的局部 变量与合并后的 "
"args。"
msgstr ""
"Skill body (execution guide), lazily evaluated — what is stored is the instruction for \"how to resolve\", "
"not the resolved result. ``skill_load()`` calls ``resolve`` on it: first expanding ``$`` file "
"references, then performing Jinja2 template rendering; the rendering context includes the calling Agent's local variables and the merged "
"args."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.Skill.content:6
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill.content:6 of
msgid ":meth:`flowing.parsable.Parsable.resolve`"
msgstr ":meth:`flowing.parsable.Parsable.resolve`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.Skill.args_schema:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill.args_schema:1 of
msgid ""
"Skill 自身声明的参数 schema——``.skill.fya`` 的 ``args:`` 块经 "
":func:`flowing.params.expand_args_schema` 归一化后的 JSON Schema "
"properties；``.md`` 形式为空 dict。LLM 不给 skill 传参，本字段的 两个消费者：``skill_add`` "
"的声明期覆盖校验（每个参数须被 ``specified`` 覆盖或有默认值，否则 ``FormatError``）与 ``skill_load``"
" 的默认值填充。空 dict 的技能开箱可用（无参数即无 覆盖义务）。"
msgstr ""
"The parameter schema declared by the Skill itself — the ``args:`` block of ``.skill.fya``, normalized via "
":func:`flowing.params.expand_args_schema` into JSON Schema "
"properties; empty dict for the ``.md`` form. The LLM does not pass arguments to skills; this field has two consumers: the declaration-time override validation of ``skill_add`` "
"(each parameter must be covered by ``specified`` or have a default value, otherwise ``FormatError``) and the default-value filling of ``skill_load``. "
"Skills with an empty dict work out of the box (no parameters means no override obligation)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.Skill.args_schema:9
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill.args_schema:9 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.params`、:class:`SkillEntry`"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.params`, :class:`SkillEntry`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.Skill.on_load:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill.on_load:1 of
msgid ""
"``$script`` 中定义的加载回调；无 ``$script`` 或未定义则为 ``None``。 ``$script`` 里的 ``def "
"on_load(self, agent, args)`` 经描述符绑定后， 框架以 ``(agent, args)`` 调用（``self`` "
"即本 Skill 实例）。时序： ``before_skill_load`` 钩子之后、``content`` 渲染之前；不拦截、 "
"不返回值（返回值被忽略）；抛异常则加载失败、异常上抛。"
msgstr ""
"The load callback defined in ``$script``; ``None`` if there is no ``$script`` or it is not defined. After ``def "
"on_load(self, agent, args)`` in ``$script`` is descriptor-bound, the framework calls it as ``(agent, args)`` (``self`` "
"is this Skill instance). Timing: after the ``before_skill_load`` hook and before ``content`` rendering; it does not intercept and "
"returns no value (the return value is ignored); raising an exception fails the load and propagates."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.Skill.on_load:7
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill.on_load:7 of
msgid ":class:`SkillLoadContext`"
msgstr ":class:`SkillLoadContext`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.Skill.registry_key:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.Skill.registry_key:1 of
msgid ""
"注册表全键（``ns::name``），``SkillRegistry`` 落账时回写；未注册 实例为 "
"``None``。``use_skill`` 预解析后对文件派生技能把本字段 落账为 ``SkillEntry.name_ori`` "
"（含目录派生命名空间的限定键，catalog 渲染 / ``skill_load`` 热路径精确命中、零文件 IO）。内部 API，不属 "
"稳定契约。"
msgstr ""
"Registry full key (``ns::name``), written back when ``SkillRegistry`` records it; unregistered instances have "
"``None``. After ``use_skill`` pre-resolution, for file-derived skills this field is recorded as ``SkillEntry.name_ori`` "
"(the qualified key with the directory-derived namespace, so the catalog rendering / ``skill_load`` hot path hits exactly with zero file IO). Internal API, not part of the "
"stable contract."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry:1 of
msgid "Skill 的 Agent 级绑定——能力三正交中的「绑定」层。"
msgstr "Agent-level binding of a Skill — the \"binding\" layer of the three orthogonal capability axes."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry:5 of
msgid ""
"同一个 ``Skill`` 在不同 Agent 上可以有不同的别名、参数覆盖与 可见性，差异全部记录在本条目上，不修改 全局 "
"``SkillRegistry`` 中的共享实例。``use_skill()`` 解析 ``agent.skills`` （``.fya`` 的 "
"``skills:`` 字段）填充 ``agent._skill_entries``， 键为别名。别名同时是 catalog ``<name>``"
" 与 ``skill-load`` / ``agent.skill_load()`` 的 ``name`` 参数的匹配目标。"
msgstr ""
"The same ``Skill`` can have different aliases, parameter overrides, and visibility on different Agents; all differences are recorded on this entry, without modifying the shared instance in the global "
"``SkillRegistry``. ``use_skill()`` parses ``agent.skills`` (the ``skills:`` field of ``.fya``) to populate ``agent._skill_entries``, "
"keyed by alias. The alias is also the match target of the catalog ``<name>`` "
"and of the ``name`` parameter of ``skill-load`` / ``agent.skill_load()``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry:30 of
msgid ""
"``enabled=False``：不进 catalog、LLM 不可见、``skill-load`` 工具 "
"入口拒绝加载；``agent.skill_load()`` 编程式加载不受影响 （可见性与可加载性分离）。"
msgstr ""
"``enabled=False``: excluded from the catalog, invisible to the LLM, and the ``skill-load`` tool "
"entry point refuses to load it; programmatic loading via ``agent.skill_load()`` is unaffected (visibility and loadability are separated)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry:33 of
msgid ""
"``args`` 的每个值进入 ``specified`` （包装 Parsable，加载时以 调用方 Agent 实例上下文求值）；``_`` "
"（PENDING）值视为未声明 该参数（不进 ``specified``，覆盖校验照常）。条目 ``args`` 的 参数键含 ``as`` → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` （无改名 通道——``param_aliases`` 已随「LLM "
"不传参」删除）。"
msgstr ""
"Each value of ``args`` goes into ``specified`` (wrapped as Parsable, evaluated at load time with the calling Agent's instance context); a ``_`` "
"(PENDING) value is treated as not declaring that parameter (not entered into ``specified``; override validation proceeds as usual). An ``args`` parameter key containing ``as`` → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` (there is no renaming channel — ``param_aliases`` was removed along with \"the LLM does not pass arguments\")."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry:38 of
msgid ""
"覆盖校验（声明期 fail-fast）：``skill_add`` 时对 ``skill.args_schema`` 逐参数检查——不在 "
"``specified`` 又无 schema 默认值 → ``FormatError``。"
msgstr ""
"Override validation (declaration-time fail-fast): at ``skill_add`` time, each parameter of ``skill.args_schema`` is checked — not in "
"``specified`` and no schema default → ``FormatError``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry:41 of
msgid ""
"``specified`` 中的注入表达式（``{{ self.inject(...) }}``）在 加载时沿 provide 链求值，缺失即 "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError` （与 Tool 侧一致）。"
msgstr ""
"Injection expressions in ``specified`` (``{{ self.inject(...) }}``) are evaluated along the provide chain at "
"load time; a missing one raises :class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError` (consistent with the Tool side)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry:44 of
msgid ""
"``override_description`` 非 ``None`` 时 catalog ``<description>`` 取覆写值而非 "
"``Skill.description``；覆写是纯 LLM 可见文本， 不影响加载与渲染正文。"
msgstr ""
"When ``override_description`` is not ``None``, the catalog ``<description>`` takes the override value instead of "
"``Skill.description``; the override is purely LLM-visible text and does not affect loading or body rendering."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry:47 of
msgid ""
"边缘情况：``name_alias == name_ori`` 是常态（未用 ``as``）； 同一 Agent 内别名唯一（重复别名 → "
":class:`flowing.errors.EntryNameConflictError`，与 tool / subagent 绑定层统一 "
"fail-fast——声明式与编程式写法背后是同一 作者，写重了即笔误）。"
msgstr ""
"Edge cases: ``name_alias == name_ori`` is the norm (``as`` unused); aliases are unique within the same Agent (duplicate alias → "
":class:`flowing.errors.EntryNameConflictError`, unified fail-fast with the tool / subagent binding layer "
"— declarative and programmatic forms have the same author behind them, so a duplicate is a typo)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry:53 of
msgid ":class:`Skill`、:class:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry`"
msgstr ":class:`Skill`, :class:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillEntry.name_alias:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry.name_alias:1 of
msgid ""
"LLM 看到的别名——catalog ``<name>`` 与 ``skill-load`` 的 ``name`` "
"参数、``agent.skill_load()`` 的 ``name`` 参数均按别名 匹配。"
msgstr ""
"The alias seen by the LLM — the catalog ``<name>``, the ``name`` parameter of ``skill-load``, "
"and the ``name`` parameter of ``agent.skill_load()`` are all matched by alias."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillEntry.name_ori:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry.name_ori:1 of
msgid "规范名——``SkillRegistry`` 中的 key，文件定向查找的依据。"
msgstr "Canonical name — the key in ``SkillRegistry``, the basis for directed file lookup."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillEntry.specified:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry.specified:1 of
msgid ""
"指定值参数——``.fya`` ``args:`` 声明的固定值（包装 Parsable， ``skill_load`` 合并时以调用方 "
"Agent 实例为上下文现场求值）。LLM 不给 skill 传参：本字段是 Skill 参数仅有的声明期来源；注入写 ``\"{{ "
"self.inject('key') }}\"`` 表达式落入本字段。"
msgstr ""
"Specified-value parameters — fixed values declared in ``.fya`` ``args:`` (wrapped as Parsable, evaluated on the spot with the calling "
"Agent instance as context when ``skill_load`` merges). The LLM does not pass arguments to skills: this field is the only declaration-time source of Skill parameters; injection written as the ``\"{{ "
"self.inject('key') }}\"`` expression lands in this field."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillEntry.override_description:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry.override_description:1 of
msgid ""
"Agent 级描述覆写（``None`` 用 ``Skill.description`` 本体）—— 与 "
":attr:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry.override_description` 同构。是 Parsable：catalog"
" 渲染时以调用方 Agent 为上下文自动求值。"
msgstr ""
"Agent-level description override (``None`` uses the ``Skill.description`` body) — "
"isomorphic to :attr:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry.override_description`. It is Parsable: at catalog "
"rendering it is automatically evaluated with the calling Agent as context."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillEntry.override_description:5
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry.override_description:5 of
msgid ":attr:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry.override_description`"
msgstr ":attr:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry.override_description`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillEntry.enabled:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillEntry.enabled:1 of
msgid ""
"是否出现在 catalog。``False`` 时 LLM 不可见且 ``skill-load`` 入口拒绝，编程式 "
"``skill_load()`` 仍可加载。"
msgstr ""
"Whether it appears in the catalog. When ``False``, it is invisible to the LLM and the ``skill-load`` entry point refuses it, while programmatic "
"``skill_load()`` can still load it."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry:1 of
msgid "Skill 注册表——``ns::name`` 全限定键 → ``Skill`` 的声明期一次性解析。"
msgstr "Skill registry — one-time declaration-time resolution of ``ns::name`` fully qualified keys to ``Skill``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry:5 of
msgid ""
"Runtime 级单例（``SkillPlugin.install()`` 创建并经 :data:`skill_registry_key` "
"provide）。持有「规范名 → Skill」缓存； ``use_skill()`` 在声明期把 Agent 声明的全部条目（含 "
"disabled） 一次性解析入缓存，此后 catalog 渲染与 ``skill_load()`` 均为纯内存 操作（文件发现优先级见模块 "
"docstring「Skill 定义文件与查找规则」）。 读取与渲染分离：读取不惰性（所有声明的定义文件在声明期一次 读入，catalog "
"渲染永不触发文件 IO）；渲染保持动态 （``description`` / ``content`` 是 Parsable，每次使用时以调用方 "
"Agent 为上下文现场求值，共享实例上不缓存渲染结果）。"
msgstr ""
"Runtime-level singleton (created by ``SkillPlugin.install()`` and provided via :data:`skill_registry_key`). "
"Holds the \"canonical name → Skill\" cache; "
"``use_skill()`` resolves all entries declared by the Agent (including "
"disabled ones) into the cache in one pass at declaration time, after which catalog rendering and ``skill_load()`` are pure in-memory "
"operations (file discovery priority: see the module docstring \"Skill definition files and lookup rules\"). Reading and rendering are separated: reading is not lazy (all declared definition files are read in once at declaration time; catalog "
"rendering never triggers file IO); rendering stays dynamic "
"(``description`` / ``content`` are Parsable, evaluated on the spot with the calling Agent as context at each use; rendered results are not cached on shared instances)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry:22 of
msgid "通常不直接调用——catalog 渲染与 ``skill_load()`` 内部经它解析。"
msgstr "Usually not called directly — catalog rendering and ``skill_load()`` resolve through it internally."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry:26 of
msgid ""
"``name`` 已在缓存 → 直接返回共享实例；否则按定向查找优先级 定位并解析定义文件，缓存后返回。常规路径下声明期 "
"（``use_skill()``）已把全部声明条目预解析入缓存；未命中分支 只服务「声明外的编程式按需解析」。"
msgstr ""
"If ``name`` is already in the cache → return the shared instance directly; otherwise locate and parse the definition file by directed-lookup priority, cache it, and return. On the regular path, declaration time "
"(``use_skill()``) has already pre-resolved all declared entries into the cache; the miss branch only serves \"programmatic on-demand resolution outside declarations\"."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry:30 of
msgid "不做目录扫描预热；不做文件变更监听（解析一次即缓存，运行期 内文件变化不生效）。"
msgstr "No directory-scan preheating; no file-change watching (parsed once and cached; file changes during runtime do not take effect)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry:32 of
msgid "同一规范名的并发解析不会发生（解析是同步文件 IO）。"
msgstr "Concurrent resolution of the same canonical name cannot happen (resolution is synchronous file IO)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry:33 of
msgid "定义文件解析失败 → 异常上抛且不写入缓存（下次引用重试）。"
msgstr "Definition file parsing failure → the exception propagates and nothing is written to the cache (the next reference retries)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry:34 of
msgid ""
"``source_dir`` 为定向查找根：引用方 Agent 定义文件所在目录 本身（不设 ``skills/`` 默认子目录，与 Agent "
"/ Tool 查找根 对齐）；显式路径 / glob 条目由 ``use_skill`` 在声明期解析为 规范名与查找根。"
msgstr ""
"``source_dir`` is the directed-lookup root: the directory containing the referencing Agent's definition file itself (no default ``skills/`` subdirectory, aligned with the Agent "
"/ Tool lookup root); explicit-path / glob entries are resolved into canonical names and lookup roots by ``use_skill`` at declaration time."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry:38 of
msgid ""
"不变量：缓存 key 是 ``ns::规范名``；同一 Runtime 内同一全键 永远解析到同一个 ``Skill`` 实例（跨 Agent "
"共享）。"
msgstr ""
"Invariants: the cache key is ``ns::canonical-name``; within the same Runtime, the same full key "
"always resolves to the same ``Skill`` instance (shared across Agents)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry:41 of
msgid ":class:`Skill`、:meth:`get`、:data:`skill_registry_key`"
msgstr ":class:`Skill`, :meth:`get`, :data:`skill_registry_key`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillRegistry.catalog_template:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.catalog_template:1 of
msgid ""
"Runtime 级默认渲染模板（``SkillPlugin.install()`` 构造注册表时 注入，即 ``SkillPlugin`` "
"构造参数的透传落点——三级解析链 「``use_skill()`` 参数 > 本属性 > 内置 "
":data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE`」 的中段通道；``None`` 表示未设 Runtime 级默认）。运行期只读。"
msgstr ""
"Runtime-level default rendering template (injected when ``SkillPlugin.install()`` constructs the registry — the pass-through landing point of the ``SkillPlugin`` "
"constructor argument, i.e. the middle channel of the three-level resolution chain \"``use_skill()`` argument > this attribute > builtin "
":data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE`\"; ``None`` means no Runtime-level default is set). Read-only during runtime."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.register:1 of
msgid "编程式注册 Skill 实例（插件随身携带技能的通道）。"
msgstr "Programmatic registration of Skill instances (the channel for plugins to carry skills with them)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.register:5 of
msgid ""
"与文件解析通道（:meth:`get`）并列的注册入口：注册表 key 为 ``ns::规范名`` "
"（``skill.name``），``namespace`` 缺省落入 ``default::``——裸名引用的注册表视图依次查 "
"``default::``、 ``builtin::`` （``default`` 优先，即覆盖通道）；自定义命名空间的 技能只能以 "
"``ns::name`` 全限定名引用（只查注册表，不走文件 查找链）。"
msgstr ""
"A registration entry point parallel to the file-parsing channel (:meth:`get`): the registry key is ``ns::canonical-name`` "
"(``skill.name``); a missing ``namespace`` falls into ``default::`` — the registry view for bare-name references looks up "
"``default::`` then ``builtin::`` in order (``default`` wins, i.e. the override channel); skills in custom namespaces can only be referenced by the "
"``ns::name`` fully qualified name (registry only, no file lookup chain)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.register:14 of
msgid ""
"``ns::name`` 全键冲突 → 抛 :class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError` "
"（消息含全键；后注册者报错，与工具 / agent 类型注册同口径）。"
msgstr ""
"``ns::name`` full-key conflict → raises :class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError` "
"(message contains the full key; the later registrant gets the error, same standard as tool / agent type registration)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.register:16 of
msgid "注册只在插件 ``install()`` 发生（运行时不增删）。"
msgstr "Registration only happens in plugin ``install()`` (no additions or removals at runtime)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.register:17 of
msgid "不做文件 IO；不校验字段完整性（字段契约是 :class:`Skill` 构造方的责任）。"
msgstr "No file IO; no field-completeness validation (the field contract is the responsibility of the :class:`Skill` constructor)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.register:20 of
msgid "已构造的 ``Skill`` 实例。"
msgstr "An already-constructed ``Skill`` instance."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.register:21 of
msgid "命名空间；``None`` → ``\"default\"``。"
msgstr "Namespace; ``None`` → ``\"default\"``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.register:23 of
msgid ":meth:`get`"
msgstr ":meth:`get`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.get:1 of
msgid "按规范名取 Skill，未命中缓存时现场解析定义文件。"
msgstr "Fetch a Skill by canonical name, resolving the definition file on the spot on cache miss."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.get:5 of
msgid ""
"注册表唯一入口。``source_dir`` 缺省时为纯注册表查询（裸名 只查 ``default::`` / "
"``builtin::``）；提供时裸名先走定向文件 查找链（文件覆盖注册表）。文件链按定向查找优先级定位（目录内 ``SKILL.fya`` >"
" ``skill.fya`` > ``<name>.skill.fya`` > ``<name>.fya`` > ``SKILL.md`` > "
"``skill.md`` → 目录外 ``<name>.skill.fya`` → ``<name>.fya`` → "
"``<name>.md``，首个 存在者生效）；定位后先按命中文件所在目录算派生键查注册表 短路复用，未注册才解析、落账（回写 "
"``skill.registry_key``） 后返回。同名 ``.fya`` 系与 ``.md`` 并存 → 告警且 ``.fya`` 系 "
"优先；命中通用名候选时规范名取目录名；链上顺序只是确定性判定 规则，不推荐同一链路真的同时存在多个候选文件。"
msgstr ""
"The registry's only entry point. When ``source_dir`` is omitted this is a pure registry query (bare names only look up ``default::`` / "
"``builtin::``); when provided, bare names first go through the directed file lookup chain (files override the registry). The file chain locates by directed-lookup priority (inside the directory ``SKILL.fya`` >"
" ``skill.fya`` > ``<name>.skill.fya`` > ``<name>.fya`` > ``SKILL.md`` > "
"``skill.md`` → outside the directory ``<name>.skill.fya`` → ``<name>.fya`` → "
"``<name>.md``; the first existing one wins); after locating, it first computes the derived key from the hit file's directory and short-circuits on a registry hit for reuse; only when unregistered does it parse, record (writing back "
"``skill.registry_key``), and return. A same-named ``.fya``-family file coexisting with ``.md`` → warn and prefer the ``.fya`` family; "
"when a generic-name candidate is hit, the canonical name is taken from the directory name; the chain order is only a deterministic decision rule — having multiple candidate files on the same chain is not recommended."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.get:17 of
msgid ""
"命名空间：``name`` 含 ``::`` 时为限定名，只查注册表精确键 （插件注册通道），不走文件查找链；文件解析产物以目录派生命名 "
"空间落账（``@/`` 下相对、根外绝对、文件夹式取上层目录；规范名 推断经 "
":func:`flowing.paths.infer_name`，规则表 :data:`SKILL_NAMING`）。"
msgstr ""
"Namespace: when ``name`` contains ``::`` it is a qualified name, looked up only as an exact registry key "
"(plugin registration channel), without the file lookup chain; file-resolution products are recorded under directory-derived namespaces "
"(relative under ``@/``, absolute outside the root, upper directory for the folder form; canonical-name inference via "
":func:`flowing.paths.infer_name`, rules table :data:`SKILL_NAMING`)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.get:25 of
msgid "返回的 ``Skill`` 是注册表共享实例；调用方不得修改。"
msgstr "The returned ``Skill`` is the registry's shared instance; callers must not modify it."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.get:26 of
msgid ""
"全部候选位置都不存在合法定义文件 → 抛 :class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError` （消息含规范名与已尝试的 "
"查找路径）；定义文件存在但解析失败（缺 ``description``、YAML 语法错误等）→ 解析异常上抛，不写入缓存。"
msgstr ""
"If no valid definition file exists at any candidate location → raises :class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError` (message contains the canonical name and the attempted "
"lookup paths); if the definition file exists but parsing fails (missing ``description``, YAML syntax errors, etc.) → the parsing exception propagates and nothing is written to the cache."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.get:30 of
msgid "不校验 ``name`` 是否被任何 Agent 声明——注册表对声明无感知 （声明是 ``SkillEntry`` 层的事）。"
msgstr "Does not check whether ``name`` is declared by any Agent — the registry is unaware of declarations (declaration is the ``SkillEntry`` layer's business)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.get:33 of
msgid "规范名（裸名 / ``ns::name`` 限定名 / 路径引用）。"
msgstr "Canonical name (bare name / ``ns::name`` qualified name / path reference)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.get:34 of
msgid "定向查找根；``None`` → 纯注册表查询。"
msgstr "Directed-lookup root; ``None`` → pure registry query."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.skills.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr "Returns"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.get:35 of
msgid "共享的 ``Skill`` 实例。"
msgstr "The shared ``Skill`` instance."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.get:36 of
msgid "按 ``name`` 在 ``source_dir`` 下找不到任何合法定义文件（含 ``source_dir`` 缺省时注册表不命中）时。"
msgstr "When no valid definition file for ``name`` is found under ``source_dir`` (including a registry miss when ``source_dir`` is omitted)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.get:39 of
msgid "定义文件存在但缺少必填 字段或格式非法时。"
msgstr "When the definition file exists but lacks required fields or has an invalid format."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.SkillRegistry.get:42 of
msgid ":class:`Skill`、:func:`use_skill`"
msgstr ":class:`Skill`, :func:`use_skill`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillLoadContext:1 of
msgid "``before_skill_load`` 钩子的 value——加载前参数上下文（可改写）。"
msgstr "The value of the ``before_skill_load`` hook — the pre-load parameter context (rewritable)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillLoadContext:5 of
msgid ""
"加载流程第 1 步的钩子 value：携带调用方 Agent、目标别名与合并后 的参数（schema 默认值 → ``specified`` "
"（含注入表达式），见 :func:`use_skill` 的「skill_load 契约」）。handler 可就地修改 ``args``，后续 "
"``on_load`` 与正文渲染使用改写后的值。"
msgstr ""
"The hook value of step 1 of the loading flow: carries the calling Agent, the target alias, and the merged "
"arguments (schema defaults → ``specified`` (including injection expressions); see the \"skill_load contract\" of :func:`use_skill`). A handler may modify ``args`` in place; subsequent "
"``on_load`` and body rendering use the rewritten values."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillLoadContext:24 of
msgid ""
"handler 三种合法出口：返回（可能改写的）value / ``raise Intercepted`` "
"（硬阻断——加载流程终止，``on_load`` 与渲染 都不执行，``after_skill_load`` 不触发）/ 普通异常（直接上抛， "
"加载失败）。"
msgstr ""
"Three legal exits for a handler: return the (possibly rewritten) value / ``raise Intercepted`` "
"(hard block — the loading flow terminates, neither ``on_load`` nor rendering runs, and ``after_skill_load`` is not triggered) / normal exception (propagates directly, "
"load fails)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillLoadContext:28 of
msgid ""
"改写语义：就地改 ``args`` dict 或整体返回替换均可被下一个 handler 看到（dispatch 改写链，见 "
":meth:`flowing.hooks.HookList.dispatch`）。"
msgstr ""
"Rewriting semantics: mutating the ``args`` dict in place or returning a replacement whole are both visible to the next handler (dispatch rewrite chain, see "
":meth:`flowing.hooks.HookList.dispatch`)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillLoadContext:31 of
msgid "边缘情况：无 handler 时 value 原样通过。"
msgstr "Edge case: with no handler, the value passes through unchanged."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillLoadContext:33 of
msgid ""
":class:`SkillContent`、 "
":class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted`、:mod:`flowing.hooks`"
msgstr ""
":class:`SkillContent`, "
":class:`flowing.errors.Intercepted`, :mod:`flowing.hooks`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillLoadContext.agent:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillLoadContext.agent:1 of
msgid "发起加载的 Agent 实例（渲染上下文与 provide 链起点）。"
msgstr "The Agent instance initiating the load (rendering context and provide-chain starting point)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillLoadContext.name:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillLoadContext.name:1 of
msgid ""
"目标 Skill 的别名（``SkillEntry.name_alias``），与 catalog ``<name>`` 一致；字段名取 "
"``name`` 是为对齐钩子点 ``match_on=\"name\"`` 的 pattern 匹配与 "
":class:`SkillContent` 的 同名属性。"
msgstr ""
"The alias of the target Skill (``SkillEntry.name_alias``), consistent with the catalog ``<name>``; the field is named "
"``name`` to align with the pattern matching of the hook point's ``match_on=\"name\"`` and the same-named attribute of "
":class:`SkillContent`."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillLoadContext.args:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillLoadContext.args:1 of
msgid ""
"合并后的参数字典（schema 默认值 → ``specified``——LLM 不传参； 注入表达式在求值时沿 provide "
"链取值）。handler 可自由改写； 后续 ``on_load`` 与正文渲染均基于改写结果。"
msgstr ""
"The merged argument dict (schema defaults → ``specified`` — the LLM does not pass arguments; "
"injection expressions take values along the provide chain at evaluation). Handlers may rewrite it freely; "
"subsequent ``on_load`` and body rendering are both based on the rewritten result."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillContent:1 of
msgid "``after_skill_load`` 钩子的 value——渲染后正文（可改写）。"
msgstr "The value of the ``after_skill_load`` hook — the rendered body (rewritable)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillContent:5 of
msgid ""
"加载流程第 4 步的钩子 value：``content.resolve()`` 的产物。 handler 可修改 ``body`` "
"（追加审计标记、裁减敏感段等），改写后的 正文进入 PLUGIN 消息与 :class:`SkillResult`。"
msgstr ""
"The hook value of step 4 of the loading flow: the product of ``content.resolve()``. Handlers may modify ``body`` "
"(append audit marks, trim sensitive sections, etc.); the rewritten body goes into the PLUGIN message and :class:`SkillResult`."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillContent:22 of
msgid ""
"handler 出口规则与 ``before_skill_load`` 相同；此处 ``raise Intercepted`` "
"使加载「看似完成但结果被丢弃」——PLUGIN 消息不入队、``skill_load()`` 不返回（异常上抛给调用方）。慎用。"
msgstr ""
"Handler exit rules are the same as ``before_skill_load``; here ``raise Intercepted`` "
"makes the load \"seemingly complete but the result discarded\" — the PLUGIN message is not enqueued and ``skill_load()`` does not return (the exception propagates to the caller). Use with care."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillContent:25 of
msgid "边缘情况：``body`` 被改为空串是合法的（PLUGIN 消息照常入队， 内容为空文本块）。"
msgstr "Edge case: rewriting ``body`` to an empty string is legal (the PLUGIN message is still enqueued, with an empty text block as content)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillContent:28 of
msgid ":class:`SkillLoadContext`、:class:`SkillResult`"
msgstr ":class:`SkillLoadContext`, :class:`SkillResult`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillContent.name:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillContent.name:1 of
msgid "已加载 Skill 的别名。"
msgstr "The alias of the loaded Skill."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillContent.body:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillContent.body:1 of
msgid ""
"渲染后的 Skill 正文。handler 可改写；最终值同时进入 PLUGIN 消息的 ``TextBlock`` 与 "
"``SkillResult.content``。"
msgstr ""
"The rendered Skill body. Handlers may rewrite it; the final value goes into both the PLUGIN message's ``TextBlock`` and "
"``SkillResult.content``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillResult:1 of
msgid "Skill 加载结果——``skill_load()`` 的返回值。"
msgstr "Skill load result — the return value of ``skill_load()``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillResult:5 of
msgid ""
"加载流程的编程式产物。它与 PLUGIN 消息承载同一份渲染正文， 但两者通道不同：``SkillResult`` 给代码调用方（含 "
"``skill-load`` 工具内部），PLUGIN 消息给 LLM（后续逻辑 Turn 的上下文）。Skill 结果不合并进 "
"ToolResult——``skill-load`` 对 LLM 只回简短收据， 正文经消息队列送达。"
msgstr ""
"The programmatic product of the loading flow. It carries the same rendered body as the PLUGIN message, "
"but through different channels: ``SkillResult`` goes to the code caller (including inside the "
"``skill-load`` tool), while the PLUGIN message goes to the LLM (context of subsequent logical Turns). Skill results are not merged into "
"ToolResult — ``skill-load`` returns only a short receipt to the LLM, and the body is delivered via the message queue."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillResult:13 of
msgid "不变量：``content`` 是 ``after_skill_load`` 钩子链之后的最终 正文，与入队 PLUGIN 消息的文本逐字相同。"
msgstr "Invariant: ``content`` is the final body after the ``after_skill_load`` hook chain, character-for-character identical to the text of the enqueued PLUGIN message."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillResult:15 of
msgid "不携带渲染耗时、来源路径等观测数据（观测走钩子）。"
msgstr "Does not carry observational data such as rendering duration or source path (observation goes through hooks)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillResult:17 of
msgid ":class:`SkillContent`、:class:`SkillLoadTool`"
msgstr ":class:`SkillContent`, :class:`SkillLoadTool`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillResult.content:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SkillResult.content:1 of
msgid "渲染后的 Skill 正文（钩子改写后的最终值）。"
msgstr "The rendered Skill body (the final value after hook rewriting)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt:1 of
msgid "Skill catalog 的动态 prompt 块——组装上下文时现场渲染。"
msgstr "Dynamic prompt block of the Skill catalog — rendered on the spot during context assembly."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt:5 of
msgid ""
"``use_skill()`` 把本类实例包装为动态 Parsable 注册进 ``agent.prompt_blocks`` "
"（``cache=\"dynamic\"``、``by=\"skill\"``、 "
"``tags=[\"skill.catalog\"]``）。每次组装上下文时 :meth:`resolve` 被调用，现场渲染当刻的 "
"catalog（enabled 过滤、参数覆盖、别名都 取当刻值）。「Lazy」只指渲染惰性：``enabled`` 状态运行时 可变、Agent"
" 局部变量（渲染上下文）随运行变化，因此 catalog 文本 每次现场渲染、不缓存。读取不惰性：Skill 定义文件已在 "
"``use_skill()`` 声明期全部解析入 ``SkillRegistry`` （含 disabled 条目），``resolve`` 只做"
" Parsable 求值与字符串拼接，不触发文件 IO。"
msgstr ""
"``use_skill()`` wraps an instance of this class as a dynamic Parsable registered into ``agent.prompt_blocks`` "
"(``cache=\"dynamic\"``, ``by=\"skill\"``, "
"``tags=[\"skill.catalog\"]``). On each context assembly :meth:`resolve` is called, rendering the current "
"catalog on the spot (enabled filtering, parameter overrides, and aliases all take current values). \"Lazy\" refers only to rendering laziness: the ``enabled`` state can change at runtime and Agent "
"local variables (the rendering context) change as it runs, so the catalog text is rendered on the spot each time without caching. Reading is not lazy: Skill definition files have all been resolved into "
"``SkillRegistry`` at ``use_skill()`` declaration time (including disabled entries); ``resolve`` only does "
"Parsable evaluation and string concatenation, triggering no file IO."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt:18 of
msgid ""
"只收集 ``enabled=True`` 的条目（声明顺序），从 ``SkillRegistry`` 取已解析的 ``Skill`` "
"（声明期已读入，无文件 IO），以 ``catalog_template`` 模板渲染整体文本（上下文 ``entries`` / "
"``agent`` 见 :data:`CatalogTemplate`）。"
msgstr ""
"Collects only ``enabled=True`` entries (in declaration order), takes the resolved ``Skill`` from ``SkillRegistry`` "
"(read in at declaration time, no file IO), and renders the whole text with the ``catalog_template`` template (context ``entries`` / "
"``agent``; see :data:`CatalogTemplate`)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt:22 of
msgid ""
"``enabled`` 是纯渲染时过滤（与 Tool / Subagent 条目语义一致）： 只影响本 catalog 与 LLM "
"可见性，不影响编程式 ``skill_load()``。"
msgstr ""
"``enabled`` is purely a render-time filter (same semantics as Tool / Subagent entries): it only affects this catalog and LLM "
"visibility, not programmatic ``skill_load()``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt:24 of
msgid ""
"无 enabled 条目 → 解析为空串，``use_skill()`` 注册的包装逻辑 跳过整块注入（catalog 不出现；``skill-"
"load`` 工具条目的存在性 不受本块影响）。"
msgstr ""
"No enabled entries → resolves to an empty string, and the wrapping logic registered by ``use_skill()`` "
"skips injecting the whole block (the catalog does not appear; the existence of the ``skill-load`` "
"tool entry is not affected by this block)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt:27 of
msgid "不缓存渲染结果；不修改任何条目状态；不触发文件 IO。"
msgstr "Does not cache rendered results; does not modify any entry state; triggers no file IO."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt:28 of
msgid ""
"管理面：整块可被 ``prompt_blocks.disable_by_tag(\"skill.catalog\")`` / "
"``disable_by_owner(\"skill\")`` 隐藏，``enable_by_tag`` 恢复， "
"``remove_by_owner(\"skill\")`` 移除——隐藏只影响 LLM 可见性， 不影响编程式加载。"
msgstr ""
"Management surface: the whole block can be hidden via ``prompt_blocks.disable_by_tag(\"skill.catalog\")`` / "
"``disable_by_owner(\"skill\")``, restored via ``enable_by_tag``, and removed via "
"``remove_by_owner(\"skill\")`` — hiding only affects LLM visibility, not programmatic loading."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt:33 of
msgid ""
":class:`flowing.context.PromptBlock`、 "
":data:`CatalogTemplate`、:data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE`"
msgstr ""
":class:`flowing.context.PromptBlock`, "
":data:`CatalogTemplate`, :data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt.resolve:1 of
msgid "现场渲染 catalog 文本（同步——只做 Parsable 求值与字符串拼接， 无 IO 等待；定义文件已全部在声明期解析入注册表）。"
msgstr "Renders the catalog text on the spot (synchronous — only Parsable evaluation and string concatenation, no IO waiting; definition files have all been resolved into the registry at declaration time)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt.resolve:6 of
msgid ""
"enabled 条目按声明序取 ``(entry, skill)`` 对，以 ``catalog_template`` "
"模板渲染整体文本（Parsable TEMPLATE 语义）；无 enabled 条目返回 ``\"\"``。"
msgstr ""
"Enabled entries are taken in declaration order as ``(entry, skill)`` pairs and rendered with the ``catalog_template`` "
"template into the whole text (Parsable TEMPLATE semantics); returns ``\"\"`` when there are no enabled entries."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt.resolve:9 of
msgid ""
"边缘情况：运行期新增声明指向的 Skill 未解析成功 → 异常上抛， 本次上下文组装失败（不静默跳过——catalog 缺条目会让 LLM 看到"
" 残缺的技能清单）；模板渲染异常（语法错等）同样 fail-fast 上抛，不静默降级。"
msgstr ""
"Edge case: if a Skill pointed to by a declaration added at runtime fails to resolve → the exception propagates and "
"this context assembly fails (no silent skipping — a catalog missing entries would show the LLM an "
"incomplete skill list); template rendering errors (syntax errors, etc.) likewise fail fast and propagate, with no silent degradation."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt.resolve:14 of
msgid "调用方 Agent 实例（模板上下文与 Parsable 求值 上下文）。"
msgstr "The calling Agent instance (template context and Parsable evaluation context)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt.resolve:16 of
msgid "catalog 文本；无 enabled 条目时为空串。"
msgstr "The catalog text; empty string when there are no enabled entries."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.LazySkillsPrompt.resolve:18 of
msgid ":class:`SkillRegistry`、:meth:`flowing.agent.Agent._assemble_context`"
msgstr ":class:`SkillRegistry`, :meth:`flowing.agent.Agent._assemble_context`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool:1 of
msgid "内置 ``skill-load`` 工具——Skill 的 LLM 入口。"
msgstr "Builtin ``skill-load`` tool — the LLM entry point for Skills."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool:5 of
msgid ""
"能力三正交中 Skill 的「LLM 可见声明」执行侧：LLM 从 ``<available_skills>`` catalog "
"选择技能后调用本工具，工具按名 透传给 ``caller.skill_load()``。工具级 schema 只声明 ``name`` ——LLM"
" 不给 skill 传参，保证 LLM 入口与代码入口行为完全一致。 Skill 加载完全复用 Tool 机制：Turn 引擎看到的就是一次普通 "
"``tool_call``。"
msgstr ""
"The execution side of Skill's \"LLM-visible declaration\" in the three orthogonal capability axes: after the LLM picks a skill from the ``<available_skills>`` catalog "
"it calls this tool, and the tool passes the name through to ``caller.skill_load()``. The tool-level schema declares only ``name`` — the LLM "
"does not pass arguments to skills, guaranteeing the LLM entry point and the code entry point behave exactly the same. Skill loading fully reuses the Tool mechanism: what the Turn engine sees is an ordinary "
"``tool_call``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool:14 of
msgid "启用后对 LLM 可见需显式声明（工具本体由 ``SkillPlugin.install()`` 注册）："
msgstr "After enablement, being visible to the LLM requires explicit declaration (the tool body is registered by ``SkillPlugin.install()``):"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool:25 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``name`` 按别名在 ``caller._skill_entries`` 查找；命中且 ``enabled=True`` → 调 "
"``skill_load(name)``；加载流程（含 PLUGIN 消息入队）见 :func:`use_skill` 的「skill_load "
"契约」。工具对 LLM 的返回是简短收据（``{\"loaded\": <别名>}``），正文不经 ToolResult——PLUGIN "
"消息在后续逻辑 Turn 进入上下文。"
msgstr ""
"``name`` is looked up by alias in ``caller._skill_entries``; on a hit with ``enabled=True`` → calls "
"``skill_load(name)``; for the loading flow (including PLUGIN message enqueueing) see the \"skill_load "
"contract\" of :func:`use_skill`. The tool's return to the LLM is a short receipt (``{\"loaded\": <alias>}``); the body does not go through ToolResult — the PLUGIN "
"message enters the context in a subsequent logical Turn."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool:30 of
msgid ""
"enabled 检查在 LLM 入口：条目 ``enabled=False`` 或未声明 → 抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError` （由 ``Tool.__call__`` 包装为 "
"``status=\"error\"`` 的 LLM 可见结果），不加载、不入队。 编程式 ``agent.skill_load()`` "
"无此检查。"
msgstr ""
"The enabled check is at the LLM entry point: an entry with ``enabled=False`` or not declared → raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError` (wrapped by ``Tool.__call__`` into an LLM-visible result with "
"``status=\"error\"``), without loading or enqueueing. Programmatic ``agent.skill_load()`` "
"has no such check."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool:34 of
msgid ""
"边缘情况：``name`` 缺失（LLM 未传）→ 按常规参数校验失败处理 （error 结果）；``before_skill_load`` 中 "
"``raise Intercepted`` → 工具调用以 ``blocked`` 告终。"
msgstr ""
"Edge cases: ``name`` missing (not passed by the LLM) → handled as a normal parameter-validation failure "
"(error result); ``raise Intercepted`` in ``before_skill_load`` → the tool call ends as ``blocked``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool:37 of
msgid ""
"前置条件：``caller`` 必须经 ``use_skill()`` 启用（否则 ``skill_load`` "
"不存在——同名属性错误，属编程错误）。"
msgstr ""
"Precondition: ``caller`` must have been enabled via ``use_skill()`` (otherwise ``skill_load`` "
"does not exist — a same-named attribute error, which is a programming error)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool:39 of
msgid "不变量：同一 Skill 一次调用只产生一条 PLUGIN 消息； ``skill-load`` 的 ToolResult 永不包含正文。"
msgstr "Invariant: one call of the same Skill produces exactly one PLUGIN message; the ToolResult of ``skill-load`` never contains the body."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool:42 of
msgid ""
":class:`flowing.tool.Tool` （``execute()`` 签名契约与 "
"返回值自动包装）、:class:`SkillResult`、:class:`SkillLoadContext`"
msgstr ""
":class:`flowing.tool.Tool` (``execute()`` signature contract and "
"automatic return-value wrapping), :class:`SkillResult`, :class:`SkillLoadContext`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.SkillLoadTool.definition:1
#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool.definition:1 of
msgid ""
"类级默认声明：``name=\"skill-load\"``、``params`` 只含 ``name``——LLM 不传参（参数合并在 "
"``skill_load()`` 内完成）。"
msgstr ""
"Class-level default declaration: ``name=\"skill-load\"``, ``params`` contains only ``name`` — the LLM does not pass arguments (argument merging happens inside "
"``skill_load()``)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool.execute:1 of
msgid "按名透传加载：``name`` 按别名解析条目。"
msgstr "Pass-through loading by name: ``name`` resolves the entry by alias."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool.execute:5 of
msgid ""
"等价于 ``return await caller.skill_load(name)`` 的收据化封装； 返回 dict 由 "
"``Tool.__call__`` 自动包装为 ``status=\"completed\"`` 的 ToolResult。"
msgstr ""
"Equivalent to a receipt-ized wrapper of ``return await caller.skill_load(name)``; the returned dict is automatically wrapped by "
"``Tool.__call__`` into a ToolResult with ``status=\"completed\"``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool.execute:8 of
msgid ""
"不自行构造 PLUGIN 消息、不做参数校验（都在 ``skill_load()``）； 不认识 ``specified`` （本工具不经 "
"``ToolEntry`` 覆写使用—— ``use_skill()`` 以默认条目注册）。"
msgstr ""
"Does not construct PLUGIN messages itself and does no parameter validation (both are in ``skill_load()``); "
"does not know ``specified`` (this tool is not used through ``ToolEntry`` overrides — "
"``use_skill()`` registers it with a default entry)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool.execute:12 of
msgid "目标 Skill 的别名（与 catalog ``<name>`` 一致）。"
msgstr "The alias of the target Skill (consistent with the catalog ``<name>``)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool.execute:13 of
msgid "发起调用的 Agent 实例（须经 ``use_skill()`` 启用）。"
msgstr "The Agent instance initiating the call (must have been enabled via ``use_skill()``)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool.execute:15 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "收据 ``{\"loaded\": <别名>}``；正文经 PLUGIN 消息送达。"
msgstr "Receipt ``{\"loaded\": <alias>}``; the body is delivered via the PLUGIN message."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool.execute:16 of
msgid ""
"``name`` 未声明或条目 ``enabled=False`` 时（由 ``Tool.__call__`` 包装为 error 结果，LLM "
"可见）。"
msgstr ""
"When ``name`` is not declared or the entry has ``enabled=False`` (wrapped by ``Tool.__call__`` into an error result, visible to the LLM)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.SkillLoadTool.execute:20 of
msgid ":meth:`flowing.tool.Tool.execute`、:class:`SkillResult`"
msgstr ":meth:`flowing.tool.Tool.execute`, :class:`SkillResult`"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:1 of
msgid "阶段二：为单个 Agent 实例启用 Skill 能力（Composable）。"
msgstr "Phase two: enable Skill capability for a single Agent instance (Composable)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:5 of
msgid ""
"在 ``setup()`` 中调用。完成后该实例拥有：catalog 动态注入、 ``skill-load`` 工具条目（对 LLM "
"可见仍需显式声明，见下）、 ``before_skill_load`` / ``after_skill_load`` 钩子点、以及绑定 方法 "
"``agent.skill_load``。声明的全部 Skill 定义文件（含 disabled "
"条目）在本调用内一次性解析入注册表（读取不惰性；解析失败在此刻 即报错，不推迟到运行期）。"
msgstr ""
"Called in ``setup()``. After completion the instance has: catalog dynamic injection, the ``skill-load`` tool entry (visibility to the LLM "
"still requires explicit declaration, see below), the ``before_skill_load`` / ``after_skill_load`` hook points, and the bound method "
"``agent.skill_load``. All declared Skill definition files (including disabled "
"entries) are resolved into the registry in one pass within this call (reading is not lazy; resolution failures are reported right here, not deferred to runtime)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:14 of
msgid "手写子类："
msgstr "Handwritten subclass:"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:25 of
msgid "``.fya`` 入口："
msgstr "``.fya`` entry:"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:44 of
msgid "严格按以下顺序执行（行为序列是契约，扩展协作依赖它）："
msgstr "Executes strictly in the following order (the behavior sequence is a contract; extension collaboration depends on it):"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:46 of
msgid ""
"``registry = agent.inject(skill_registry_key)``——未安装 ``SkillPlugin`` 时此处抛"
" :class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`。"
msgstr ""
"``registry = agent.inject(skill_registry_key)`` — raises"
" :class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError` here when ``SkillPlugin`` is not installed."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:49 of
msgid ""
"``agent.hooks.declare(\"before_skill_load\", by=\"skill\")`` 与 "
"``declare(\"after_skill_load\", by=\"skill\")``——幂等声明：同名且 同 ``by`` "
"重复调用返回已有 ``HookList`` （不报错）；仅同名而 不同 ``by`` 才抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.DuplicateHookPointError`。"
msgstr ""
"``agent.hooks.declare(\"before_skill_load\", by=\"skill\")`` and "
"``declare(\"after_skill_load\", by=\"skill\")`` — idempotent declaration: repeated calls with the same name and the same ``by`` "
"return the existing ``HookList`` (no error); only the same name with a different ``by`` raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.DuplicateHookPointError`."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:54 of
msgid ""
"绑定 ``agent.skill_add`` （「检查后跳过」，与第 6/7 步同律； 契约见下「skill_add "
"契约」）——条目装配的单点，下一步 逐条委托它。"
msgstr ""
"Binds ``agent.skill_add`` (\"bind after checking\", same rule as steps 6/7; "
"contract in \"skill_add contract\" below) — the single point of entry assembly, to which the next step delegates entry by entry."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:57 of
msgid ""
"解析 ``agent.skills`` （``.fya`` 的 ``skills:`` 落入 ``_extra`` "
"的原始声明；无该字段视为空列表；字段声明为 ``_`` （PENDING） 但未赋值兑现 → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError`）：裸名 / ``as`` 别名 / 显式路径 / glob 形态经 "
":func:`flowing.parser.normalize_entries` （``naming=SKILL_NAMING``）规范化为 "
"``EntryRef``；glob 项先行 展开并排除已显式声明的规范名。逐条委托 ``agent.skill_add(ref)`` "
"——条目构造、注册表一次性预解析（含 disabled 条目，读取不 惰性，失败此刻即报错）、``name_ori`` 落账都在 "
"``skill_add`` 内完成。"
msgstr ""
"Parses ``agent.skills`` (the raw declaration of ``.fya``'s ``skills:`` landing in ``_extra``; "
"absence of the field is treated as an empty list; a field declared as ``_`` (PENDING) but never fulfilled → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError`): bare-name / ``as`` alias / explicit-path / glob forms are normalized by "
":func:`flowing.parser.normalize_entries` (``naming=SKILL_NAMING``) into "
"``EntryRef``; glob items are expanded first, excluding canonical names already explicitly declared. Each entry is delegated to ``agent.skill_add(ref)`` "
"— entry construction, one-shot registry pre-resolution (including disabled entries; reading is not lazy, failures are reported right here), and ``name_ori`` recording are all done inside "
"``skill_add``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:67 of
msgid ""
"解析渲染模板（只收模板字符串）：本函数 ``catalog_template`` 参数 > ``SkillPlugin`` 构造参数 > 内置 "
":data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE`；构造 :class:`LazySkillsPrompt` 并注册进 "
"``agent.prompt_blocks`` （``cache=\"dynamic\"``、 "
"``by=\"skill\"``、``tags=[\"skill.catalog\"]``）。"
msgstr ""
"Resolves the rendering template (only template strings are accepted): this function's ``catalog_template`` argument > ``SkillPlugin`` constructor argument > builtin "
":data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE`; constructs :class:`LazySkillsPrompt` and registers it into "
"``agent.prompt_blocks`` (``cache=\"dynamic\"``, "
"``by=\"skill\"``, ``tags=[\"skill.catalog\"]``)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:72 of
msgid ""
"绑定 ``agent.skill_load`` （见下「skill_load 契约」）；采用 「检查后跳过」——仅当 agent "
"当前没有该函数才绑定 （``hasattr`` 检查，含类级方法）。理由：开发者可能已定义了自己 "
"的加载逻辑，绑定方不得覆盖（``flowing.plugins`` 的绑函数约定）。"
msgstr ""
"Binds ``agent.skill_load`` (see \"skill_load contract\" below); uses \"bind after checking\" — bound only when the agent "
"currently has no such function (``hasattr`` check, including class-level methods). Rationale: the developer may have defined their own "
"loading logic, and the binder must not override it (the bind-function convention of ``flowing.plugins``)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:76 of
msgid ""
"绑定 ``agent.skill_get`` （上下文感知的技能解析门面，薄委托 ``SkillRegistry.get(name, "
"source_dir=agent.source_dir())``）； 同「检查后跳过」律。"
msgstr ""
"Binds ``agent.skill_get`` (a context-aware skill-resolution facade, thinly delegating to ``SkillRegistry.get(name, "
"source_dir=agent.source_dir())``); same \"bind after checking\" rule."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:80 of
msgid ""
"工具可见性：本函数不代绑 ``skill-load``——工具对 LLM 可见只经 ``.fya`` ``tools:`` 声明或用户显式 "
"``agent.add_tool(\"skill-load\")``， 工具本体由 ``SkillPlugin.install()`` 在 "
"Runtime 级注册。"
msgstr ""
"Tool visibility: this function does not bind ``skill-load`` on your behalf — the tool becomes visible to the LLM only via a ``.fya`` ``tools:`` declaration or an explicit "
"``agent.add_tool(\"skill-load\")``; the tool body is registered at Runtime level by ``SkillPlugin.install()``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:84 of
msgid ""
"幂等性边界：第 2 步的钩子点声明与第 3/6/7 步的函数绑定对同一 实例重复调用是安全的（幂等 / 检查后跳过）；但对同一实例第二次 "
"完整调用本函数会在第 4 步因别名已存在抛 :class:`flowing.errors.EntryNameConflictError` "
"（``skill_add`` 的 fail-fast）。恢复时 ``setup()`` 在新实例上执行， 不触发此路径。"
msgstr ""
"Idempotency boundary: the hook-point declaration of step 2 and the function bindings of steps 3/6/7 are safe to repeat on the same "
"instance (idempotent / bind after checking); but a second full call of this function on the same instance raises :class:`flowing.errors.EntryNameConflictError` at step 4 because the alias already exists "
"(``skill_add``'s fail-fast). On recovery, ``setup()`` runs on a new instance and does not trigger this path."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:91 of
msgid ""
"skill_load 契约（``async def skill_load(name: str) -> "
"SkillResult``，由本函数绑定为实例方法）："
msgstr ""
"skill_load contract (``async def skill_load(name: str) -> "
"SkillResult``, bound by this function as an instance method):"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:94 of
msgid ""
"按别名查 ``_skill_entries``；未声明 → 抛 ``KeyError`` （编程 错误，属调用方责任）。不做 enabled "
"检查（编程式入口的特权）。"
msgstr ""
"Looks up ``_skill_entries`` by alias; undeclared → raises ``KeyError`` "
"(programming error, the caller's responsibility). No enabled check (the privilege of the programmatic entry point)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:96 of
msgid ""
"经 ``registry.get(entry.name_ori)`` 取共享 ``Skill`` "
"（声明期已预解析并落账解析键——文件派生技能为派生 限定键，本步为纯内存查找）。"
msgstr ""
"Gets the shared ``Skill`` via ``registry.get(entry.name_ori)`` "
"(pre-resolved at declaration time with the resolution key recorded — a derived qualified key for file-derived skills; this step is a pure in-memory lookup)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:99 of
msgid ""
"参数合并（LLM 不传参；优先级低 → 高依次覆盖）： ``args_schema`` 默认值 → ``specified`` （以调用方 "
"Agent 实例 上下文现场求值；其中注入表达式 ``{{ self.inject('key') }}`` 在求值时沿 provide "
"链上溯，缺失 → :class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`）。覆盖完整性已在 "
"``skill_add`` 声明期校验，本步无缺参失败分支。"
msgstr ""
"Argument merging (the LLM does not pass arguments; priority low → high, each overriding the previous): "
"``args_schema`` defaults → ``specified`` (evaluated on the spot with the calling Agent instance as context; "
"injection expressions ``{{ self.inject('key') }}`` therein walk up the provide chain at evaluation, missing → :class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`). Override completeness was already validated at "
"``skill_add`` declaration time, so this step has no missing-argument failure branch."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:105 of
msgid ""
"dispatch ``before_skill_load`` （value 为 :class:`SkillLoadContext`，可改 "
"args；``Intercepted`` 终止后续 步骤）。"
msgstr ""
"Dispatch ``before_skill_load`` (value is :class:`SkillLoadContext`, can rewrite "
"args; ``Intercepted`` terminates subsequent steps)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:108 of
msgid "``skill.on_load(agent, args)`` （若存在；不拦截、不返回值）。"
msgstr "``skill.on_load(agent, args)`` (if present; does not intercept, returns no value)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:109 of
msgid ""
"``rendered = skill.content.resolve(...)`` （渲染上下文包含 agent 局部变量与合并 args；先 "
"``$`` 展开再 Jinja2，同步）。"
msgstr ""
"``rendered = skill.content.resolve(...)`` (the rendering context includes agent local variables and the merged args; first "
"``$`` expansion, then Jinja2, synchronous)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:111 of
msgid "dispatch ``after_skill_load`` （value 为 :class:`SkillContent`， 可改正文）。"
msgstr "Dispatch ``after_skill_load`` (value is :class:`SkillContent`, can rewrite the body)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:113 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``agent.enqueue_message(Message(kind=MessageKind.PLUGIN, "
"source=f\"skill:{name}\", content=[TextBlock(text=body)], "
"priority=MessagePriority.NORMAL))``。"
msgstr ""
"``agent.enqueue_message(Message(kind=MessageKind.PLUGIN, "
"source=f\"skill:{name}\", content=[TextBlock(text=body)], "
"priority=MessagePriority.NORMAL))``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:116 of
msgid "返回 ``SkillResult(content=body)``。"
msgstr "Returns ``SkillResult(content=body)``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:118 of
msgid "不把正文合并进任何 ToolResult；不检查 LLM 是否「真的看过 catalog」；不做加载次数限制。"
msgstr "Does not merge the body into any ToolResult; does not check whether the LLM has \"actually seen the catalog\"; imposes no load-count limit."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:121 of
msgid ""
"skill_add 契约（``def skill_add(name: str | EntryRef, *, alias: str | None ="
" None, body: dict | None = None) -> SkillEntry``， 由本函数绑定为实例方法——与 "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool` / ``add_agent`` 同构的第三条资源管线）："
msgstr ""
"skill_add contract (``def skill_add(name: str | EntryRef, *, alias: str | None ="
" None, body: dict | None = None) -> SkillEntry``, bound by this function as an instance method — the third resource pipeline isomorphic to "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.add_tool` / ``add_agent``):"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:126 of
msgid ""
"归一：``name`` 为 ``EntryRef`` 时 ``alias``/``body`` 必须 缺省（重复 → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError`）；为 ``str`` 时经 "
":func:`flowing.parser.normalize_entries` （``naming=SKILL_NAMING``）构造 "
"EntryRef。``str`` 接受全部引用 形态，与 ``.fya`` 声明一致：裸名 / ``ns::name`` / 相对或绝对 路径 /"
" 路径带裸名。"
msgstr ""
"Normalization: when ``name`` is an ``EntryRef``, ``alias``/``body`` must be omitted (duplicates → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError`); when it is a ``str``, an EntryRef is constructed via "
":func:`flowing.parser.normalize_entries` (``naming=SKILL_NAMING``). ``str`` accepts all reference "
"forms, consistent with ``.fya`` declarations: bare name / ``ns::name`` / relative or absolute path / "
"path with bare name."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:132 of
msgid ""
"body 判别（单点）：键集固定 ``description`` / ``args`` / ``enabled`` （无 ``inject`` "
"键——注入写 args 里的 ``\"{{ self.inject('key') }}\"`` 表达式）；未知键 → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError`。去向：``description`` → "
"``override_description`` （``str`` 包装 Parsable，``Parsable`` 透传，``_`` → 空补丁"
" ``None``；catalog 渲染时以调用方 Agent 为上下文自动求值）；``args`` → 每个值进 ``specified`` "
"（包装 Parsable，加载时以调用方 Agent 实例上下文求值——注入表达式 同路）；``_`` （PENDING）值视为未声明该参数（不进"
" ``specified``）；``args`` 键含 ``as`` → ``FormatError``，无改名 通道；``enabled`` →"
" 布尔原样。"
msgstr ""
"body discrimination (single point): the key set is fixed to ``description`` / ``args`` / ``enabled`` (no ``inject`` "
"key — injection is written as the ``\"{{ self.inject('key') }}\"`` expression inside args); unknown keys → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError`. Destinations: ``description`` → "
"``override_description`` (``str`` wrapped as Parsable, ``Parsable`` passed through, ``_`` → empty patch "
"``None``; automatically evaluated with the calling Agent as context at catalog rendering); ``args`` → each value goes into ``specified`` "
"(wrapped as Parsable, evaluated at load time with the calling Agent instance as context — injection expressions take the same path); ``_`` (PENDING) values are treated as not declaring that parameter (not entered into "
"``specified``); ``args`` keys containing ``as`` → ``FormatError``, no renaming channel; ``enabled`` → "
"boolean as-is."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:143 of
msgid ""
"冲突：同 alias 已存在 → :class:`flowing.errors.EntryNameConflictError` （绑定层统一 "
"fail-fast）。"
msgstr ""
"Conflict: same alias already exists → :class:`flowing.errors.EntryNameConflictError` (unified fail-fast at the binding layer)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:146 of
msgid ""
"预解析、落账与覆盖校验：``registry.get(entry.name_ori, "
"source_dir=agent.source_dir())`` 一次性解析（含 disabled， 失败此刻即报错）；文件派生技能把 "
"``entry.name_ori`` 落账为 派生限定键（``skill.registry_key``），注册表命中 "
"（``default::``/``builtin::``）保持裸名。覆盖校验： 对 ``skill.args_schema`` 逐参数检查——不在"
" ``specified`` 又无 schema 默认值 → :class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` （声明期 "
"fail-fast）。"
msgstr ""
"Pre-resolution, recording, and override validation: ``registry.get(entry.name_ori, "
"source_dir=agent.source_dir())`` resolves in one pass (including disabled entries; failures are reported right here); for file-derived skills, "
"``entry.name_ori`` is recorded as the derived qualified key (``skill.registry_key``), while registry hits "
"(``default::``/``builtin::``) keep the bare name. Override validation: each parameter of ``skill.args_schema`` is checked — not in "
"``specified`` and no schema default → :class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` (declaration-time "
"fail-fast)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:154 of
msgid ""
"写入 ``agent._skill_entries[entry.name_alias]`` 并返回条目。 同步、立即生效（下一次 catalog "
"渲染可见）。"
msgstr ""
"Writes ``agent._skill_entries[entry.name_alias]`` and returns the entry. "
"Synchronous, effective immediately (visible at the next catalog rendering)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:157 of
msgid ""
"时序约束：深层块（``$skills.<alias>.xxx:``）的填回先于 ``skill_add`` 调用（装配层先 merge 具名块，与"
" tool 侧同律）。"
msgstr ""
"Timing constraint: deep blocks (``$skills.<alias>.xxx:``) are filled back before the ``skill_add`` call (the assembly layer merges named blocks first, same rule as the "
"tool side)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:160 of
msgid "要启用的 Agent 实例。"
msgstr "The Agent instance to enable."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:161 of
msgid "Agent 级渲染模板（覆盖 Runtime 级； 缺省 ``None``）。"
msgstr "Agent-level rendering template (overrides the Runtime level; default ``None``)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:163 of
msgid "未安装 ``SkillPlugin`` 而调用本函数（第 1 步 inject）时。"
msgstr "When this function is called without ``SkillPlugin`` installed (step 1 inject)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:165 of
msgid ""
"``agent.skills`` 声明形态非法 （非列表 / PENDING 未兑现）、条目 body 含未知键或 ``args`` 键含 "
"``as``、覆盖校验未通过时。"
msgstr ""
"When the ``agent.skills`` declaration form is illegal "
"(not a list / PENDING unfulfilled), an entry body contains unknown keys or an ``args`` key contains "
"``as``, or override validation fails."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:168 of
msgid "对同一实例重复 调用本函数（别名已存在）时。"
msgstr "When this function is called repeatedly on the same instance (alias already exists)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.use_skill:171 of
msgid ""
":class:`SkillPlugin` （阶段一入口）、 :class:`SkillLoadTool` （LLM 入口，与 "
"``skill_load`` 同路径）、 :class:`SkillEntry` （``skills:`` 声明的绑定产物）"
msgstr ""
":class:`SkillPlugin` (the phase-one entry point), :class:`SkillLoadTool` (the LLM entry point, same path as "
"``skill_load``), :class:`SkillEntry` (the binding product of the ``skills:`` declaration)"

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.skills.rst:10
msgid "Submodules"
msgstr "Submodules"

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.skills.rst:13
msgid "flowing.plugins.skills.models module"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.skills.models module"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models:1 of
msgid "``flowing.plugins.skills.models`` —— Skill 扩展的数据对象。"
msgstr "``flowing.plugins.skills.models`` — data objects of the Skill extension."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models:3 of
msgid ""
"本模块定义 Skill 扩展的全部数据对象：:data:`SKILL_NAMING` （技能文件 "
"的身份名推断规则表）、:data:`CatalogTemplate` （catalog 渲染模板的 类型别名）、:class:`Skill` "
"（可执行对象）、:class:`SkillEntry` （Agent 级绑定）、:class:`SkillLoadContext` / "
":class:`SkillContent` （加载流程两个钩子点的 value）、:class:`SkillResult` "
"（``skill_load`` 的返回值）。"
msgstr ""
"This module defines all data objects of the Skill extension: :data:`SKILL_NAMING` "
"(the identity-name inference rules table for skill files), :data:`CatalogTemplate` (the type alias of the catalog rendering template), :class:`Skill` "
"(the executable object), :class:`SkillEntry` (the Agent-level binding), :class:`SkillLoadContext` / "
":class:`SkillContent` (the values of the two hook points of the loading flow), :class:`SkillResult` "
"(the return value of ``skill_load``)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models:10 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.skills` （扩展的启用方式与整体契约）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.skills.registry` （注册表）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.skills.skills` （插件与加载流程）"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.skills` (enablement and overall contract of the extension), "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.skills.registry` (the registry), "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.skills.skills` (plugin and loading flow)"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SKILL_NAMING:1 of
msgid "Skill 定义文件的身份名推断规则表（:class:`flowing.paths.NamingRules`）。"
msgstr "Identity-name inference rules table for Skill definition files (:class:`flowing.paths.NamingRules`)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SKILL_NAMING:3 of
msgid ""
"``use_skill()`` 解析 ``skills:`` 条目时把本规则表传给 "
":func:`flowing.parser.normalize_entries`，技能名的推断规则如下："
msgstr ""
"When ``use_skill()`` parses ``skills:`` entries it passes this rules table to "
":func:`flowing.parser.normalize_entries`; the inference rules for skill names are as follows:"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SKILL_NAMING:6 of
msgid ""
"命中 ``<name>.skill.fya`` / ``<name>.fya`` / ``<name>.md`` 候选 → "
"身份名取文件名去扩展名的部分；"
msgstr ""
"Hitting ``<name>.skill.fya`` / ``<name>.fya`` / ``<name>.md`` candidates → "
"the identity name is the file name with the extension removed;"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SKILL_NAMING:8 of
msgid ""
"命中通用名候选（``SKILL.fya`` / ``skill.fya`` / ``SKILL.md`` / ``skill.md``）→ "
"身份名取所在目录名（与 Agent 的 ``agent.fya`` 命中取目录名同一规则）。"
msgstr ""
"Hitting generic-name candidates (``SKILL.fya`` / ``skill.fya`` / ``SKILL.md`` / ``skill.md``) → "
"the identity name is the containing directory name (same rule as taking the directory name on an ``agent.fya`` hit for Agents)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.models.SKILL_NAMING:12 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.paths.infer_name`、:func:`flowing.parser.normalize_entries`"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.paths.infer_name`, :func:`flowing.parser.normalize_entries`"

#: ../../../docstring builtins.str:1 of
msgid "catalog 渲染模板的类型别名——只收 Jinja2 模板源字符串。"
msgstr "Type alias of the catalog rendering template — accepts only Jinja2 template source strings."

#: ../../../docstring builtins.str:3 of
msgid ""
"本类型是 catalog 的唯一渲染槽位：模板内容是 Jinja2 模板源字符串 （可以是 ``$./file.j2`` "
"这类文件引用形式），不接受 callable 渲染器——定制渲染风格即整体替换模板字符串，内置模板 "
":data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE` 公开可参考。"
msgstr ""
"This type is the catalog's only rendering slot: the template content is a Jinja2 template source string "
"(file-reference forms like ``$./file.j2`` are allowed); callable renderers are not accepted — customizing the rendering style means replacing the whole template string; the builtin template "
":data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE` is public for reference."

#: ../../../docstring builtins.str:8 of
msgid "模板上下文变量："
msgstr "Template context variables:"

#: ../../../docstring builtins.str:10 of
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"``entries``：``list[tuple[SkillEntry, Skill]]``——「(条目, 已解析 Skill)」对列表，只含 "
"``enabled=True`` 的条目，顺序即 ``skills:`` "
"声明顺序；空列表时模板应渲染为空串（:class:`LazySkillsPrompt` 据此跳过整块注入，内置模板以 ``{% if "
"entries %}`` 保证）。"
msgstr ""
"``entries``: ``list[tuple[SkillEntry, Skill]]`` — a list of \"(entry, resolved Skill)\" pairs, containing only "
"``enabled=True`` entries, in ``skills:`` "
"declaration order; with an empty list the template should render an empty string (:class:`LazySkillsPrompt` skips injecting the whole block based on this, and the builtin template guarantees it with ``{% if "
"entries %}``)."

#: ../../../docstring builtins.str:14 of
msgid ""
"``agent``：调用方 Agent 实例。条目的描述字段是 :class:`flowing.parsable.Parsable`，模板内以 "
"``(entry.override_description or skill.description).resolve(agent)`` "
"现场求值（每次渲染现场 resolve、无缓存）。"
msgstr ""
"``agent``: the calling Agent instance. Entry description fields are :class:`flowing.parsable.Parsable`; the template evaluates them on the spot with "
"``(entry.override_description or skill.description).resolve(agent)`` "
"(resolve on the spot at each render, no caching)."

#: ../../../docstring builtins.str:21 of
msgid ""
"渲染经 Parsable TEMPLATE 语义（先展开 ``$`` 文件引用，再执行 Jinja2 模板渲染；``include`` "
"的基准目录是调用方 Agent 的 ``source_dir``）。"
msgstr ""
"Rendering goes through Parsable TEMPLATE semantics (first expanding ``$`` file references, then performing Jinja2 template rendering; the base directory of ``include`` "
"is the calling Agent's ``source_dir``)."

#: ../../../docstring builtins.str:24 of
msgid "渲染异常 fail-fast 上抛（fail-fast：失败立即报错，不静默降级）。"
msgstr "Rendering exceptions fail fast and propagate (fail-fast: failures are reported immediately, no silent degradation)."

#: ../../../docstring builtins.str:25 of
msgid ""
"条目中的 ``Skill`` 已在声明期解析入注册表，模板渲染本身不触发 文件 IO（``$`` FILE_REF "
"模板例外：模板源自身的读取发生在求值时）。"
msgstr ""
"The ``Skill`` objects in the entries have already been resolved into the registry at declaration time; template rendering itself does not trigger "
"file IO (except for ``$`` FILE_REF templates: reading the template source itself happens at evaluation time)."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.skills.rst:21
msgid "flowing.plugins.skills.registry module"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.skills.registry module"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry:1 of
msgid "``flowing.plugins.skills.registry`` —— Skill 注册表与注入键。"
msgstr "``flowing.plugins.skills.registry`` — the Skill registry and injection key."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry:3 of
msgid ""
"本模块定义 :data:`skill_registry_key` （provide 注入键）与 :class:`SkillRegistry` "
"（``ns::name`` 全限定键 → 已解析 ``Skill`` 的 注册表）。Skill 定义文件的解析（三种形式统一解析为 "
":class:`Skill` 实例）也在这里完成（``_parse_skill_*`` 系列内部函数）。"
msgstr ""
"This module defines :data:`skill_registry_key` (the provide injection key) and :class:`SkillRegistry` "
"(the registry of ``ns::name`` fully qualified keys → resolved ``Skill``). Parsing of Skill definition files (uniform resolution of the three forms into "
":class:`Skill` instances) also happens here (the ``_parse_skill_*`` family of internal functions)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry:8 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.skills` （扩展的启用方式与整体契约）、 "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.skills.models` （数据对象）"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.skills` (enablement and overall contract of the extension), "
":mod:`flowing.plugins.skills.models` (data objects)"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.skill_registry_key:1 of
msgid "全局 ``SkillRegistry`` 实例在 provide 链上的注入键。"
msgstr "The injection key of the global ``SkillRegistry`` instance on the provide chain."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.skill_registry_key:3 of
msgid ""
"``SkillPlugin.install()`` 以该键把注册表 provide 到 Runtime 根（键名 为 "
"``\"skill_registry\"``）；``use_skill()`` 经 "
"``agent.inject(skill_registry_key)`` 消费（沿亲代链上溯，命中 Runtime 根级存储）。"
msgstr ""
"``SkillPlugin.install()`` provides the registry to the Runtime root under this key (key name "
"``\"skill_registry\"``); ``use_skill()`` consumes it via "
"``agent.inject(skill_registry_key)`` (walking up the parent chain, hitting the Runtime root-level storage)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.skill_registry_key:10 of
msgid "同 key 重复 provide 是覆盖更新（后者生效）——插件间靠键名前缀 约定避免冲突（provide 机制的全局约定）。"
msgstr "Repeated provide of the same key is an overwriting update (the later one wins) — plugins avoid conflicts via key-name prefix conventions (a global convention of the provide mechanism)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.skill_registry_key:12 of
msgid ""
"未安装 ``SkillPlugin`` 时 inject 该键抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`。"
msgstr ""
"Injecting this key without ``SkillPlugin`` installed raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.registry.skill_registry_key:15 of
msgid ""
":class:`flowing.params.InjectionKey`、:class:`SkillPlugin`、 "
":func:`use_skill`、:meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.inject`"
msgstr ""
":class:`flowing.params.InjectionKey`, :class:`SkillPlugin`, "
":func:`use_skill`, :meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.inject`"

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.skills.rst:29
msgid "flowing.plugins.skills.skills module"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.skills.skills module"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:1 of
msgid ""
"flowing.plugins.skills —— Skill 扩展（SkillPlugin / Skill / SkillEntry / "
"SkillRegistry / SkillLoadTool / use_skill）。"
msgstr ""
"flowing.plugins.skills — Skill extension (SkillPlugin / Skill / SkillEntry / "
"SkillRegistry / SkillLoadTool / use_skill)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:5 of
msgid ""
"Skill 扩展是 Flowing 的内置扩展（随 ``flowing`` 包发布但不自动 启用），为 Agent "
"提供「按名加载一段提示词」的能力：Agent 在 ``agent.fya`` 的 ``skills:`` 字段声明技能，LLM 从 catalog"
" 中看到 可用技能清单，需要时经 ``skill-load`` 工具按名加载详细执行指南。"
msgstr ""
"The Skill extension is a builtin extension of Flowing (shipped with the ``flowing`` package but not enabled "
"automatically), giving Agents the ability to \"load a prompt segment by name\": an Agent declares skills in the ``skills:`` field of ``agent.fya``, the LLM sees the available-skill list in the catalog, "
"and loads the detailed execution guide by name via the ``skill-load`` tool when needed."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:10 of
msgid ""
"框架核心不感知 Skill：``agent.fya`` 的 ``skills:`` 字段不是核心 保留字，宽松 YAML 解析把它静默保留在 "
"Agent 的 ``_extra`` 中，由本 模块的 ``use_skill(self)`` 在 ``setup()`` "
"阶段解析（``Agent.__getattr__`` 对未定义属性回退 ``_extra`` 查找，扩展直接读 ``agent.skills`` "
"即可）。 Skill 的加载路径也不走 Turn 引擎硬编码——LLM 经 ``skill-load`` 工具 调用加载，框架看到的只是一次普通 "
"``tool_call`` （Tool / 子 Agent 在 Turn 引擎中有硬编码调用点，Skill 完全复用 Tool 机制）。"
msgstr ""
"The framework core is unaware of Skills: the ``skills:`` field of ``agent.fya`` is not a core reserved word; lenient YAML parsing silently keeps it in the Agent's "
"``_extra``, to be parsed by this module's ``use_skill(self)`` during ``setup()`` "
"(``Agent.__getattr__`` falls back to ``_extra`` lookup for undefined attributes, so extensions can simply read ``agent.skills``). "
"Skill loading also does not go through Turn-engine hardcoding — the LLM loads via the ``skill-load`` tool, and all the framework sees is an ordinary "
"``tool_call`` (Tools / sub-Agents have hardcoded call sites in the Turn engine; Skills fully reuse the Tool mechanism)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:18 of
msgid ""
"启用遵循双层启用模型：阶段一 ``runtime.install(SkillPlugin(...))`` 注册全局 "
"``SkillRegistry`` 与 ``skill-load`` 工具；阶段二 ``use_skill(self)`` 为单个 Agent "
"实例启用。"
msgstr ""
"Enablement follows the two-phase enablement model: phase one ``runtime.install(SkillPlugin(...))`` registers the global "
"``SkillRegistry`` and the ``skill-load`` tool; phase two ``use_skill(self)`` enables a single Agent "
"instance."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:23 of
msgid "注册面清单"
msgstr "Registry-Surface Inventory"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:24 of
msgid "启用方式："
msgstr "Enablement:"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:26 of
msgid ""
"阶段一：``runtime.install(SkillPlugin(...))``——``install()`` 同步完成 全部注册（重复 "
"``install()`` 同一插件实例属编程错误，见 :class:`SkillPlugin`）；"
msgstr ""
"Phase one: ``runtime.install(SkillPlugin(...))`` — ``install()`` completes all registration synchronously (repeated "
"``install()`` of the same plugin instance is a programming error; see :class:`SkillPlugin`);"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:29 of
msgid ""
"阶段二：``setup()`` 中 ``use_skill(self)``——恢复时 ``setup()`` "
"在新实例上执行，安全；对同一实例重复调用本 函数会在条目装配处抛 ``EntryNameConflictError`` （钩子点声明幂等、 "
"绑定函数「检查后跳过」，但条目别名不重复登记，见 :func:`use_skill` 行为要点）。"
msgstr ""
"Phase two: ``use_skill(self)`` in ``setup()`` — on recovery ``setup()`` "
"runs on a new instance, which is safe; calling this function repeatedly on the same instance raises ``EntryNameConflictError`` at entry assembly (hook-point declaration is idempotent, "
"bound functions are \"bind after checking\", but entry aliases are not registered twice; see the Key Behaviors of :func:`use_skill`)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:35 of
msgid "注册的资源："
msgstr "Registered resources:"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:37 of
msgid ""
"provide key：:data:`skill_registry_key` "
"（``InjectionKey[\"SkillRegistry\"]``， 键名 ``\"skill_registry\"``），provide "
"到 Runtime 根；消费方式 ``agent.inject(skill_registry_key)`` （沿亲代链上溯）；未安装 "
"``SkillPlugin`` 时 inject 抛 :class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`。"
msgstr ""
"Provide key: :data:`skill_registry_key` "
"(``InjectionKey[\"SkillRegistry\"]``, key name ``\"skill_registry\"``), provided "
"to the Runtime root; consumed via ``agent.inject(skill_registry_key)`` (walking up the parent chain); injecting without "
"``SkillPlugin`` installed raises :class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:42 of
msgid ""
"工具注册：:class:`SkillLoadTool` （``skill-load``）注册进 Runtime "
"全局工具注册表——注册不等于可见：对 LLM 可见仍需 Agent 侧显式 声明（``.fya`` ``tools:`` 或 "
"``agent.add_tool(\"skill-load\")``）。"
msgstr ""
"Tool registration: :class:`SkillLoadTool` (``skill-load``) is registered into the Runtime "
"global tool registry — registration is not visibility: being visible to the LLM still requires an explicit Agent-side declaration (``.fya`` ``tools:`` or "
"``agent.add_tool(\"skill-load\")``)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:45 of
msgid ""
"``runtime.register_skill``：``install()`` 把 :meth:`SkillRegistry.register`"
" 绑定为该属性（绑函数约定：检查后 跳过；未安装本插件时该属性不存在）。"
msgstr ""
"``runtime.register_skill``: ``install()`` binds :meth:`SkillRegistry.register` "
"to this attribute (bind-function convention: bind after checking; the attribute does not exist when this plugin is not installed)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:48 of
msgid ""
"Agent 侧 ``prompt_blocks`` 动态块：:class:`LazySkillsPrompt`， 注册参数 "
"``cache=\"dynamic\"``、``by=\"skill\"``、 "
"``tags=[\"skill.catalog\"]``——整块可用 "
"``agent.prompt_blocks.disable_by_tag(\"skill.catalog\")`` / "
"``disable_by_owner(\"skill\")`` 隐藏、``enable_by_tag`` 恢复、 "
"``remove_by_owner(\"skill\")`` 移除（只影响 LLM 可见性，不影响 编程式加载）。"
msgstr ""
"Agent-side ``prompt_blocks`` dynamic block: :class:`LazySkillsPrompt`, registered with "
"``cache=\"dynamic\"``, ``by=\"skill\"``, "
"``tags=[\"skill.catalog\"]`` — the whole block can be hidden via "
"``agent.prompt_blocks.disable_by_tag(\"skill.catalog\")`` / "
"``disable_by_owner(\"skill\")``, restored via ``enable_by_tag``, removed via "
"``remove_by_owner(\"skill\")`` (affects only LLM visibility, not programmatic loading)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:55 of
msgid ""
"``agent.skill_add`` / ``agent.skill_load`` / ``agent.skill_get``： "
"``use_skill()`` 按「检查后跳过」绑定（用户已自定义同名函数时 保留用户的）。"
msgstr ""
"``agent.skill_add`` / ``agent.skill_load`` / ``agent.skill_get``: "
"bound by ``use_skill()`` with \"bind after checking\" (user-defined same-named functions are kept)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:59 of
msgid ""
"声明的钩子点：``before_skill_load`` / ``after_skill_load`` （``by=\"skill\"``， "
"``match_on=\"name\"``），由 ``use_skill()`` 声明、 由 ``skill_load`` 流程在该 Agent "
"实例上 dispatch（谁声明谁 dispatch）。注册开放：声明后任何扩展都可挂 handler，无需再声明。"
msgstr ""
"Declared hook points: ``before_skill_load`` / ``after_skill_load`` (``by=\"skill\"``, "
"``match_on=\"name\"``), declared by ``use_skill()`` and dispatched by the ``skill_load`` flow on that Agent "
"instance (whoever declares dispatches). Registration is open: after declaration any extension can attach handlers without further declaration."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:64 of
msgid ""
"挂载的钩子：本插件不挂任何 handler（扫描 / 审计等属于策略层， 由其他扩展按 ``by=\"guardrail\"`` / "
"``by=\"audit\"`` 等自行挂载）。"
msgstr ""
"Attached hooks: this plugin attaches no handlers (scanning / auditing etc. belong to the policy layer; other extensions attach them on their own under ``by=\"guardrail\"`` / "
"``by=\"audit\"`` etc.)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:67 of
msgid ""
"未启用时的行为（未安装 ``SkillPlugin`` 的 Runtime、未调用 ``use_skill()`` 的 Agent）：零开销——无"
" catalog 注入、无 ``skill-load`` 工具条目、无 ``before_skill_load`` / "
"``after_skill_load`` 钩子点（访问抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError`）、无 ``agent.skill_load`` "
"方法；此时调用 ``use_skill(self)`` 抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`。"
msgstr ""
"Behavior when not enabled (a Runtime without ``SkillPlugin`` installed, an Agent without ``use_skill()`` called): zero overhead — no "
"catalog injection, no ``skill-load`` tool entry, no ``before_skill_load`` / "
"``after_skill_load`` hook points (accessing them raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.UnknownHookPointError`), no ``agent.skill_load`` "
"method; calling ``use_skill(self)`` in this state raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:76 of
msgid "Skill 定义文件与查找规则"
msgstr "Skill definition files and lookup rules"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:77 of
msgid ""
"Skill 定义是文件资源，三种等价形式（``SkillRegistry`` 统一解析为 同一个 :class:`Skill` 类的实例，无「内置"
" / 自定义」类层次差异）："
msgstr ""
"A Skill definition is a file resource in three equivalent forms (``SkillRegistry`` uniformly resolves them into instances of the same :class:`Skill` class, with no \"builtin "
"/ custom\" class-hierarchy difference):"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:80 of
msgid ""
"``.md`` 形式：YAML frontmatter（``---`` 包裹，字段与 ``.skill.fya`` 的 YAML 块同构）和 "
"Markdown 正文。``name`` 一律 推断（命中 ``<name>.md`` 取文件名；命中通用名 ``SKILL.md`` / "
"``skill.md`` 取目录名，kebab-case）；frontmatter 中不禁止写 "
"``name``，但仅作一致性断言——与推断值不符抛 :class:`flowing.errors.NameMismatchError` （与 "
"Agent / Tool 同一 语义）。``description`` 必填；正文支持 Jinja2 模板。"
msgstr ""
"``.md`` form: YAML frontmatter (wrapped in ``---``, fields isomorphic to the YAML block of ``.skill.fya``) and a "
"Markdown body. ``name`` is always inferred (hitting ``<name>.md`` takes the file name; hitting generic names ``SKILL.md`` / "
"``skill.md`` takes the directory name, kebab-case); writing "
"``name`` in the frontmatter is not forbidden, but it serves only as a consistency assertion — a mismatch with the inferred value raises :class:`flowing.errors.NameMismatchError` (same semantics as "
"Agent / Tool). ``description`` is required; the body supports Jinja2 templates."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:87 of
msgid ""
"``.skill.fya`` 形式：块结构声明，字段见 :class:`Skill`；可含 ``$script`` 块定义 ``on_load``"
" 回调。注意 ``.skill.fya`` 的 ``$script`` 与 Agent ``.fya`` 的 ``$script`` "
"用途不同：前者只 定义 ``on_load``，后者定义 ``setup()`` / ``@on()`` 钩子 / 实例方法。"
msgstr ""
"``.skill.fya`` form: block-structure declaration; fields in :class:`Skill`; may contain a ``$script`` block defining the ``on_load`` "
"callback. Note that ``$script`` in ``.skill.fya`` differs in purpose from ``$script`` in Agent ``.fya``: the former only "
"defines ``on_load``, while the latter defines ``setup()`` / ``@on()`` hooks / instance methods."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:91 of
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid "目录形式：复杂 Skill 用目录组织，正文可 ``{% include %}`` 引用目录内的参考资料 / 术语表。"
msgstr "Directory form: complex Skills are organized as directories; the body may reference reference materials / glossaries inside the directory via ``{% include %}``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:94 of
msgid "定向查找优先级（按规范名 ``<name>``，首个存在者生效）："
msgstr "Directed-lookup priority (by canonical name ``<name>``; the first existing one wins):"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:96 of
msgid ""
"``<name>/`` 目录（若存在）→ 目录内 ``SKILL.fya`` > ``skill.fya`` > "
"``<name>.skill.fya`` > ``<name>.fya`` > ``SKILL.md`` > ``skill.md``"
msgstr ""
"``<name>/`` directory (if it exists) → inside the directory ``SKILL.fya`` > ``skill.fya`` > "
"``<name>.skill.fya`` > ``<name>.fya`` > ``SKILL.md`` > ``skill.md``"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:98 of
msgid "``<name>.skill.fya``"
msgstr "``<name>.skill.fya``"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:99 of
msgid "``<name>.fya``"
msgstr "``<name>.fya``"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:100 of
msgid "``<name>.md``"
msgstr "``<name>.md``"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:102 of
msgid "细则（与 Agent / Tool 查找链同口径）："
msgstr "Details (same standard as the Agent / Tool lookup chains):"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:104 of
msgid ""
"``.fya`` 系优先于 ``.md``：同名 ``.fya`` 系与 ``.md`` 并存 → 告警且 ``.fya`` 系优先（对齐 "
"Tool 的「``.fya`` 优先于同名 ``.py`` 并告警」）。"
msgstr ""
"The ``.fya`` family takes precedence over ``.md``: a same-named ``.fya``-family file coexisting with ``.md`` → warn and prefer the ``.fya`` family (aligned with the "
"Tool rule \"``.fya`` takes precedence over a same-named ``.py`` and warns\")."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:107 of
msgid ""
"裸名 vs 显式路径分流：裸名条目语境下目录存在但无合法定义文件 → 继续向下查找；显式路径条目语境下目录无候选 → 直接抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` （定点引用的目录为空几乎必为 笔误；分流在 ``use_skill()``"
" 声明期执行——条目规范化经 :func:`flowing.parser.normalize_entries` "
"（``naming=SKILL_NAMING``）， 形态判别经 :func:`flowing.paths.classify_ref`； "
":meth:`SkillRegistry.get` 只承接裸名语义）。"
msgstr ""
"Bare-name vs explicit-path divergence: in a bare-name entry context, a directory that exists but has no valid definition file → continue looking down the chain; in an explicit-path entry context, a directory with no candidates → raise "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` directly (an empty directory at a fixed-point reference is almost certainly a typo; the divergence is performed at ``use_skill()``"
" declaration time — entry normalization via :func:`flowing.parser.normalize_entries` "
"(``naming=SKILL_NAMING``), form discrimination via :func:`flowing.paths.classify_ref`; "
":meth:`SkillRegistry.get` only carries bare-name semantics)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:114 of
msgid ""
"名字推断：机制本体 :func:`flowing.paths.infer_name` （规则表 :data:`SKILL_NAMING`）——命中"
" ``<name>.xxx`` 候选 → 取文件名； 命中通用名候选（``SKILL.fya`` / ``skill.fya`` / "
"``SKILL.md`` / ``skill.md``）→ 取目录名（对齐 Agent「``agent.fya`` 命中取 目录名」的推断规则）。"
msgstr ""
"Name inference: the mechanism itself is :func:`flowing.paths.infer_name` (rules table :data:`SKILL_NAMING`) — hitting "
"``<name>.xxx`` candidates → take the file name; hitting generic-name candidates (``SKILL.fya`` / ``skill.fya`` / "
"``SKILL.md`` / ``skill.md``) → take the directory name (aligned with the Agent inference rule of \"take the directory name on an ``agent.fya`` hit\")."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:119 of
msgid ""
"插件注册通道：``runtime.register_skill()`` → :meth:`SkillRegistry.register` "
"编程式注册（key 为 ``ns::规范名``）。 裸名条目先查注册表裸名视图（``default::`` 优先于 ``builtin::``， "
"default 优先，即覆盖通道），未命中才走上述文件查找链；``ns::name`` 限定名条目只查注册表。命名空间永不进入 LLM "
"可见面——catalog 与 ``skill-load`` 只暴露规范名 / 别名。"
msgstr ""
"Plugin registration channel: ``runtime.register_skill()`` → :meth:`SkillRegistry.register` "
"programmatic registration (key is ``ns::canonical-name``). "
"Bare-name entries first query the registry's bare-name view (``default::`` before ``builtin::``, "
"default wins, i.e. the override channel), and only on a miss go through the file lookup chain above; ``ns::name`` qualified-name entries only query the registry. Namespaces never enter the LLM-"
"visible surface — the catalog and ``skill-load`` expose only canonical names / aliases."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:125 of
msgid "链上顺序只是确定性判定规则——不推荐同一链路真的同时存在多个 候选文件（属组织异味：读者需回溯优先级才能确定生效者）。"
msgstr "The chain order is only a deterministic decision rule — having multiple candidate files on the same chain is not recommended (an organizational smell: readers must trace back the priority to determine which takes effect)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:128 of
msgid ""
"全部不存在 → 解析失败（见 :meth:`SkillRegistry.get`）。 PENDING 是 ``.fya`` 里的 ``_`` "
"占位值，表示该字段留待运行期赋值； 除 ``skills: _`` 的 PENDING 声明外不存在自动扫描，所有 Skill 均经 Agent "
"显式引用触发定向查找；``skills:`` 条目支持裸名 / 显式 相对路径 / glob 三形态，glob "
"展开时规范名与已显式声明条目相同的跳过 （先解析显式条目，再展开 glob）。"
msgstr ""
"If none exist → resolution fails (see :meth:`SkillRegistry.get`). PENDING is the ``_`` "
"placeholder value in ``.fya``, meaning the field is left to be assigned at runtime; apart from the ``skills: _`` PENDING declaration there is no automatic scanning — every Skill triggers directed lookup via an explicit Agent "
"reference; ``skills:`` entries support three forms — bare name / explicit relative path / glob — and during glob "
"expansion, entries whose canonical name matches an already explicitly declared one are skipped (explicit entries are resolved first, then globs are expanded)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:136 of
msgid "catalog 与加载流程"
msgstr "Catalog and loading flow"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:137 of
msgid ""
"catalog 懒注入：``use_skill()`` 把 :class:`LazySkillsPrompt` 注册为 "
"``prompt_blocks`` 的动态块，每次组装上下文现场渲染——catalog 内容 反映当刻的 ``enabled`` "
"状态与参数覆盖，无任何缓存（渲染惰性；定义 文件已在声明期一次读入）。正文（content）由 LLM 经 ``skill-load`` "
"决定使用时才按需加载并渲染。catalog 中 ``<name>`` 是别名 "
"（``SkillEntry.name_alias``）；catalog 无 ``<params>`` 段（LLM 不给 skill "
"传参，见下节）；只有 ``enabled=True`` 的条目进入 catalog。"
msgstr ""
"Catalog lazy injection: ``use_skill()`` registers :class:`LazySkillsPrompt` as a dynamic block of "
"``prompt_blocks``, rendered on the spot at each context assembly — the catalog content "
"reflects the current ``enabled`` state and parameter overrides, with no caching (rendering is lazy; definition files were read in once at declaration time). The body (content) is loaded and rendered on demand only when the LLM decides to use it via ``skill-load``. "
"In the catalog, ``<name>`` is the alias "
"(``SkillEntry.name_alias``); the catalog has no ``<params>`` section (the LLM does not pass arguments to skills, "
"see the next section); only ``enabled=True`` entries enter the catalog."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:145 of
msgid "加载流程（LLM 入口与代码入口是同一执行路径，详见 :func:`use_skill` 的「skill_load 契约」）："
msgstr "Loading flow (the LLM entry point and the code entry point are the same execution path; see the \"skill_load contract\" of :func:`use_skill` for details):"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:148 of
msgid ""
"``before_skill_load`` 钩子（value 为 :class:`SkillLoadContext`， 可改 args、可 "
"``raise Intercepted`` 阻止加载）。"
msgstr ""
"``before_skill_load`` hook (value is :class:`SkillLoadContext`, can rewrite args, can "
"``raise Intercepted`` to block loading)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:150 of
msgid "``skill.on_load(agent, args)``——Skill 自己的初始化（不拦截、 不返回值）。"
msgstr "``skill.on_load(agent, args)`` — the Skill's own initialization (does not intercept, returns no value)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:152 of
msgid ""
"``skill.content.resolve(...)``——先展开 ``$`` 引用，再执行 Jinja2 模板渲染（两步渲染顺序不可配置，见"
" :mod:`flowing.parsable`）。"
msgstr ""
"``skill.content.resolve(...)`` — first expand ``$`` references, then perform Jinja2 template rendering (the two-step rendering order is not configurable; see"
" :mod:`flowing.parsable`)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:154 of
msgid "``after_skill_load`` 钩子（value 为 :class:`SkillContent`，可改 渲染后正文）。"
msgstr "``after_skill_load`` hook (value is :class:`SkillContent`, can rewrite the rendered body)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:156 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"渲染结果不合并进 ToolResult，而是以独立 ``Message`` 入队： "
"``kind=MessageKind.PLUGIN``、``source=f\"skill:{name}\"``、 "
"``priority=MessagePriority.NORMAL``；``skill_load()`` 返回 "
":class:`SkillResult`。"
msgstr ""
"The rendering result is not merged into a ToolResult but enqueued as a standalone ``Message``: "
"``kind=MessageKind.PLUGIN``, ``source=f\"skill:{name}\"``, "
"``priority=MessagePriority.NORMAL``; ``skill_load()`` returns "
":class:`SkillResult`."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:161 of
msgid ""
"PLUGIN 消息进入消息级树（``Message.id`` 与 ``parent_id`` 构成的链、正常 落盘），在后续逻辑 Turn "
"被消费时进入 LLM 上下文。Skill 结果 （PLUGIN）与子 Agent 结果（SUBAGENT）永远不会与 TOOL 结果混淆—— "
"Provider adapter 构建 LLM 上下文时按 ``kind`` 单独处理。"
msgstr ""
"The PLUGIN message enters the message-level tree (the chain formed by ``Message.id`` and ``parent_id``, persisted normally) and enters the LLM context when consumed in subsequent logical Turns. Skill results "
"(PLUGIN) and sub-Agent results (SUBAGENT) are never confused with TOOL results — "
"the Provider adapter handles them separately by ``kind`` when building the LLM context."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:167 of
msgid "Skill 参数（全部来自声明期）"
msgstr "Skill parameters (all from declaration time)"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:168 of
msgid ""
"LLM 不给 skill 传参：``skill-load`` 工具与 ``agent.skill_load()`` 只有 ``name`` "
"一个入口参数；catalog 不渲染 ``<params>`` 段。Skill "
"声明的每个参数（``args_schema``）必须在声明期被覆盖——来源只有 两个，``specified`` （固定值 / 注入表达式 "
"``{{ self.inject(...) }}``） 优先于 schema 默认值。``specified`` 的值语义与 Tool / 子 "
"Agent 完全相同（包装 Parsable、加载时以调用方 Agent 实例上下文求值； 注入表达式在求值时沿 provide 链上溯、缺失即 "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`）；声明期覆盖校验： ``skill_add`` "
"时逐参数检查——不在 ``specified`` 又无 schema 默认值 → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` （fail-fast：失败立即报错， 不静默降级；不留到运行期）。 需要 "
"LLM 传参的能力应建模为 Tool。"
msgstr ""
"The LLM does not pass arguments to skills: the ``skill-load`` tool and ``agent.skill_load()`` have only ``name`` "
"as an entry parameter; the catalog does not render a ``<params>`` section. Every parameter declared by a Skill "
"(``args_schema``) must be covered at declaration time — there are only two sources: ``specified`` (fixed values / injection expressions "
"``{{ self.inject(...) }}``), which takes precedence over schema defaults. The value semantics of ``specified`` are exactly the same as for Tools / sub-"
"Agents (wrapped as Parsable, evaluated at load time with the calling Agent instance as context; injection expressions walk up the provide chain at evaluation, missing → "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`); declaration-time override validation: at ``skill_add`` "
"time each parameter is checked — not in ``specified`` and no schema default → "
":class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` (fail-fast: failures are reported immediately, no silent degradation; nothing deferred to runtime). Capabilities that need "
"LLM-passed arguments should be modeled as Tools."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:183 of
msgid "手写子类（``setup()`` 中启用并挂钩子）："
msgstr "Handwritten subclass (enabled and hooked in ``setup()``):"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:194 of
msgid "``.fya`` 声明（``skills:`` 字段与 ``$script`` 里启用）："
msgstr "``.fya`` declaration (enabled in the ``skills:`` field and in ``$script``):"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:212 of
msgid "行为要点（跨符号约定）"
msgstr "Key Behaviors (cross-symbol conventions)"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:213 of
msgid ""
"enabled 语义：「可见性」与「可加载性」分离： ``enabled=False`` 的条目不进 catalog、LLM 看不到、无法经 "
"``skill-load`` 工具加载（LLM 入口做 enabled 检查），但仍可编程式 ``await "
"agent.skill_load(\"name\")`` 加载——代码入口不做 enabled 检查。与 "
"``ToolEntry.enabled`` / ``SubagentEntry.enabled`` 语义一致。"
msgstr ""
"enabled semantics: \"visibility\" and \"loadability\" are separated: entries with "
"``enabled=False`` do not enter the catalog, are invisible to the LLM, and cannot be loaded via the "
"``skill-load`` tool (the LLM entry point performs the enabled check), but can still be loaded programmatically via ``await "
"agent.skill_load(\"name\")`` — the code entry point does no enabled check. Consistent with "
"``ToolEntry.enabled`` / ``SubagentEntry.enabled`` semantics."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:218 of
msgid ""
"覆写策略（检查后跳过）：``use_skill()`` 挂载回调（``skill_load`` 绑定、prompt "
"块、工具条目）采用「检查后跳过」——实例上已有同名 定义时保留用户定义（``setup()`` 中后执行的扩展覆盖先执行扩展挂载 "
"的回调，调用顺序即优先级）。"
msgstr ""
"Override policy (bind after checking): the callbacks attached by ``use_skill()`` (``skill_load`` binding, prompt "
"block, tool entry) use \"bind after checking\" — when a same-named definition already exists on the instance, the user definition is kept (an extension executed later in ``setup()`` overrides callbacks attached by earlier extensions; "
"call order is priority)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:222 of
msgid ""
"渲染模板：catalog 渲染只设一个槽位 ``catalog_template`` （Jinja2 模板源字符串，含 "
"``$./file.j2`` FILE_REF 形式；不接受 callable 渲染器——定制即整体替换模板，内置 "
":data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE` 公开可参考）。配置来源两级： Agent 级（``use_skill(self,"
" catalog_template=...)`` 参数）覆盖 Runtime 级（``SkillPlugin`` "
"构造参数）；两者都缺省时用内置模板。 模板上下文变量（``entries`` / ``agent``）见 "
":data:`CatalogTemplate`。"
msgstr ""
"Rendering template: catalog rendering has a single slot ``catalog_template`` "
"(a Jinja2 template source string, including the ``$./file.j2`` FILE_REF form; callable renderers are not accepted — customization means replacing the whole template; the builtin "
":data:`DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE` is public for reference). Two configuration levels: "
"Agent level (the ``use_skill(self, catalog_template=...)`` argument) overrides Runtime level (the ``SkillPlugin`` "
"constructor argument); the builtin template is used when both are absent. "
"Template context variables (``entries`` / ``agent``): see :data:`CatalogTemplate`."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:232 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.tool` —— ``Tool`` / ``ToolDefinition`` / ``ToolEntry``， "
"Skill 复用 Tool 机制（参数优先级一致，见上文）。"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.tool` — ``Tool`` / ``ToolDefinition`` / ``ToolEntry``; "
"Skills reuse the Tool mechanism (parameter priorities are consistent; see above)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:234 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.hooks` —— ``HookRegistry.declare`` / dispatch 算法。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.hooks` — ``HookRegistry.declare`` / dispatch algorithm."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:235 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.parsable` —— ``Parsable.resolve`` 与两步渲染。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.parsable` — ``Parsable.resolve`` and two-step rendering."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:236 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.message` —— ``MessageKind.PLUGIN`` 与消息级树。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.message` — ``MessageKind.PLUGIN`` and the message-level tree."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills:237 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.errors` —— ``Intercepted`` / ``MissingProvideError``。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.errors` — ``Intercepted`` / ``MissingProvideError``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:1 of
msgid "内置默认 catalog 模板：把逐条 ``<skill>`` 片段包进 ``<available_skills>``。"
msgstr "Builtin default catalog template: wraps the per-entry ``<skill>`` fragments into ``<available_skills>``."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:5 of
msgid ""
"唯一渲染槽位的内置缺省值。槽位只收 Jinja2 模板字符串，不接受 callable 渲染器——定制渲染风格即整体替换模板（本常量公开可参考 /"
" 派生）。"
msgstr ""
"The builtin default value of the only rendering slot. The slot accepts only Jinja2 template strings, not callable renderers — customizing the rendering style means replacing the whole template (this constant is public for reference /"
" derivation)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:9 of
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"模板上下文（:data:`CatalogTemplate` 变量表）：``entries`` 为 ``(entry, skill)`` "
"对列表（顺序即 ``skills:`` 声明顺序，模板不得 重排）；``agent`` 为调用方 Agent。描述字段为 Parsable—— "
"``override_description`` （非 ``None`` 时优先）或 ``skill.description`` 在模板内经 "
"``.resolve(agent)`` 现场求值（每次渲染现场 resolve、 无缓存）。空列表经 ``{% if entries %}`` "
"渲染为 ``\"\"`` （整块不注入； ``LazySkillsPrompt`` 在此之前也有短路）。"
msgstr ""
"Template context (the :data:`CatalogTemplate` variable table): ``entries`` is a list of ``(entry, skill)`` "
"pairs (in ``skills:`` declaration order; the template must not reorder); ``agent`` is the calling Agent. Description fields are Parsable — "
"``override_description`` (preferred when not ``None``) or ``skill.description`` is evaluated on the spot in the template via "
"``.resolve(agent)`` (resolve on the spot at each render, no caching). An empty list renders as ``\"\"`` via ``{% if entries %}`` "
"(the whole block is not injected; "
"``LazySkillsPrompt`` also short-circuits before this)."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:17 of
msgid "无 ``<params>`` 段——LLM 不给 skill 传参，条目对 LLM 只暴露 名称与描述。"
msgstr "No ``<params>`` section — the LLM does not pass arguments to skills; entries expose only name and description to the LLM."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:22 of
msgid "产物形态："
msgstr "Product form:"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:33 of
msgid "自定义（整体替换，文件承载）："
msgstr "Customization (full replacement, file-backed):"

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:41 of
msgid ""
"渲染经 Parsable TEMPLATE 语义（include 基准为该 agent 的 ``source_dir``）；渲染异常 fail-"
"fast 上抛，不静默降级。"
msgstr ""
"Rendering goes through Parsable TEMPLATE semantics (the include base is that agent's ``source_dir``); rendering exceptions fail "
"fast and propagate, with no silent degradation."

#: flowing.plugins.skills.skills.DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:44 of
msgid ":data:`CatalogTemplate`、:class:`LazySkillsPrompt`"
msgstr ":data:`CatalogTemplate`, :class:`LazySkillsPrompt`"
